INSERT INTO Review VALUES('4ae44935-10c0-4e9c-8620-88c8373dc902','140cc7a0-c0b5-4f1b-ac7c-3a636b489e47','Really good massage! Super precession','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('4bff63f6-af36-4eab-8c01-5648677e7f1f','2a1649ed-fd73-468b-a1cc-fc73f6b3dd15','Preciosa cabaña para pasar tus días en Urubamba, los anfitriones muy atentos, el cuarto era muy espacioso, camas cómodas y agua caliente en la ducha. Los jardines que tienes alrededor de la cabaña muy bien cuidados y dan mucha paz para tu estadía. Altamente recomendado...','Sofia Nogales',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('01c93970-1aee-480b-8e18-ac00263da29d','2a1649ed-fd73-468b-a1cc-fc73f6b3dd15','Nos quedamos dos personas en una habitación muy acogedora, espaciosa, cómoda y encantadora. Los alrededores de la habitación eran jardines muy bien cuidados con árboles de frutas como limones, peras, higos, manzanas. También muchas flores de colores y por las mañana podías ver colibríes volando. Muy hermoso caminar por los jardines. La atención fue excelente. Nos brindaron muchos datos útiles para llegar rapido y facil a SamanaWasi. En la habitación había agua para beber, hervidora eléctrica, cafetera, platos mesa por si llevábamos nuestra comida.','Aránzazu Otero',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('5c26e129-2c76-4247-ab0a-14135f2676d0','2a1649ed-fd73-468b-a1cc-fc73f6b3dd15','Un lugar muy lindo agradable tranquilo y un nombre muy llamativo','Alex Quillahuaman Quispe',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('5c24dc40-3959-4a1f-aea3-b23f610154e9','fbdfdc77-f073-4b7f-86eb-0032d9896423','Qué sitio tan especial... Al lado del río, entre las montañas del Valle Sagrado... Y qué personas tan especiales y mágicas... Familia.. medicina.. gracias por todo!!!','Raúl Moreno',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('f785f6a9-81f7-463b-a328-3b9133662e4f','fbdfdc77-f073-4b7f-86eb-0032d9896423','Gracias a la familia MaiNaiYana por ésta experiencia, que sin duda no olvidaré. Sin duda un hogar donde volver y disfrutar de gente única.','Jorge Sanchez',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('8442919f-3bdd-494e-bda2-ef87afd788db','fbdfdc77-f073-4b7f-86eb-0032d9896423','I was so depressed. Over working all the time. I had no value in my life after my girlfriend broke up with me for 8 years. But my friend invited me to come to Peru to the ashram. And I was so excited when I got here! The sites, the people and the currency is very affordable! The people at the ashram helped me come back to myself and closer to God. I was heard, I was seen and I am loved! I love my life and I will never got back to hating myself again. They are my family. I am very blessed to be here and this is just the beginning!','L Hideki',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('abd61655-809e-4b37-b109-62907e5a7c1d','283787a1-1e32-472d-882c-5eb63112e017',replace('Très bel hôtel, chambres spacieuses et neuves, du moins pour une partie de l’hôtel (qui semble encore être en construction à certains endroits).\nIl y avait mêmes des alpagas juste à côté de l’hôtel !\nIl y a également une salle de sport avec des tapis de course et une piscine chauffée. Malheureusement, la table de billard et la table de ping pong étaient très endommagées à cause de l’humidité de la piscine, qui est dans le même hangar.\n\nAttention : Nous avons été victime d’une erreur (ou peut être d’une arnaque) lors de la facturation des boissons de notre chambre : une boisson a été payée en double et le personnel semblait refuser de comprendre cela.\nNous avons cependant réussi à récupérer notre argent à la fin d’une longue discussion.','\n',char(10)),'Julien',2);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('a66f5843-e4d6-4ba0-b7ec-aee8c85292b0','283787a1-1e32-472d-882c-5eb63112e017','El hotel super agradable, el personal amable, la comida estaba muy rica. Las habitaciones amplias y confortables. La cama muy cómoda, estuvimos 4 dias y lo único malo es que nunca nos enteramos que había la opción de habitación con jacuzzi porque la habríamos cogido! Igualmente la piscina estaba muy bien y las instalaciones agradables','Paulina Tapia Riveros',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('a52460e8-4e49-4624-bc54-0e2da2747199','a7b6ea44-c430-4eac-b0fc-165fba773c94',replace('Don’t hesitate for a second — this place is truly special. From the moment you walk through the door until the moment you leave, you feel embraced, cared for, and renewed. If you’re looking to detox your mind, body, and spirit, this is exactly where you need to be.\nSurrounded by the breathtaking Andes mountains, the energy here is on another level. The service is exceptional — heartfelt, attentive, and far beyond what you’d expect, even from a 5-star hotel. The Arbol Team genuinely makes you feel seen and supported.\nBetween the meditation sessions, yoga, cleansing programs, and spa treatments, every day feels like a gift to yourself. You’ll not only detox — you’ll learn how to truly care for your body. The food is completely organic, fresh, and delicious.\nI had one of the best experiences of my life here. I would recommend this place endlessly. You arrive as a guest… and you leave feeling like family. Thanks Arbol Team!','\n',char(10)),'Juan Carlos Torrejon',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('241f9eb5-46d2-4540-9aff-6194eed65362','a7b6ea44-c430-4eac-b0fc-165fba773c94','Detox intensive increíble!!!! 1000% recomendado','SANDRA REATEGUI',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('694feb5d-9451-4e0a-9485-01d1553cc001','a7b6ea44-c430-4eac-b0fc-165fba773c94',replace('Tuve la oportunidad de vivir la experiencia  del detox de una semana y fue sencillamente maravilloso. Experiencia sanadora y energizante. El espacio es bellísimo y las personas que trabajan en el lugar lo son aún más. Carmela Aldave dirige el lugar de una manera muy responsable y profesional, con muchísimos conocimientos valiosos para comenzar una nueva etapa de nuestra vida con mejor salud y una vida más plena.\nLa comida es deliciosa y, además, sanadora.\nSi tienen la posibilidad de ir, VAYAN. Háganse ese regalo.','\n',char(10)),'Despilfa',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('15e52d24-3649-4ee1-a6f1-729276a3e642','c03bbdfd-ea33-49b6-9abf-9b3e644f0d23',replace('A Life-Changing Experience, Deeply Healing and Beautifully Held!\n\nI recently attended this ayahuasca retreat that has truly changed my life. From the start, the team put incredible thought into preparing us for the ceremonies. The workshops are thoughtfully curated to give you the tools and mindset to enter the experience feeling ready, grounded, and open. Everything is designed with intention.\n\nWe had powerful sessions exploring childhood trauma and identifying our trauma responses, which gave me a deep understanding of my emotional patterns. Another workshop around victimhood helped shift my perspective and reclaim my personal power. We also had group-building workshops that created a real sense of safety and connection, making it easier to open up and share authentically throughout the week.\n\nNina’s yoga sessions are a highlight. Gentle, grounding, and always adapted to the group’s needs. Her deep presence and intuition extend into the music she curates for the ceremonies. The sound journey she creates is powerful, striking a perfect balance between being emotionally moving and deeply enjoyable. It acts as a beautiful guide throughout the experience.\n\nBefore the ceremonies, you also have access to wonderful bodywork like massages to reconnect with yourself, which I found incredibly helpful. There are even laundry services for those arriving from long travels. These small touches make a big difference in feeling at home and supported.\n\nDuring the ceremonies, Hector’s presence brings a strong sense of safety and calm. His experience is clear, and his gentle guidance, especially around the first hour mark or the booster time, makes you feel held and cared for throughout the journey.\n\nLais takes care of everything behind the scenes with such attention and kindness. If you have a logistical issue or feedback, she’s there to ensure it’s taken care of immediately. And then there’s Miro, whose spontaneous conversations somehow always land with clarity and insight, helping you make sense of your journey in subtle and profound ways.\n\nThe food deserves a mention too, healthy, fresh, locally sourced, and absolutely delicious. You truly feel nourished on every level.\n\nThis retreat helped me process deep grief, become more aware of patterns in my life, and gain closure on past traumas. The environment, the people, and the structure created a container that felt incredibly safe, loving, and transformative.\n\nIf you''re considering an ayahuasca retreat, I wholeheartedly recommend this one. It is not only deeply healing but also thoughtfully and beautifully facilitated from beginning to end.','\n',char(10)),'aline neven',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('72ab3280-7ed3-4884-bd26-31c39c31598c','c03bbdfd-ea33-49b6-9abf-9b3e644f0d23',replace('This retreat was one of the most meaningful and well-organized experiences I’ve had. The setting was beautiful, the food nourishing, and the ceremonies and workshops were thoughtfully planned to support real inner work.\n\nThe Ayahuasca ceremonies were led with care and presence. I really appreciated how Hector created a sense of connection by calling us "family" and regularly checking in with us. Being able to sit under the stars during the night ceremonies was especially powerful. The workshops like Childhood Regression, Victimhood, etc. were also a key part of the process. They helped prepare the ground for deeper experiences during ceremonies and gave us tools to make sense of what was coming up. The yoga and breathwork added a lot as well, supporting both body and mind through the journey.\n\nThis retreat offers a rare and supportive space for personal healing and growth. It feels genuine and well held. Overall, it was a deeply valuable journey, and I’d recommend it to anyone ready to do honest, inner work and reconnect with themselves.','\n',char(10)),'Soul Cartographer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('13454c3e-02c3-457b-9d14-92016dcb9aca','c03bbdfd-ea33-49b6-9abf-9b3e644f0d23',replace('I would like to thank the staff for their caring and support throughout the whole retreat. They created an inspirational and safe place. I remembered their calm walk, as they were keeping an eye on us during ceremonies. It was a feeling of safety and comfort. Selection of songs during sessions, made up of both softer and harder ones maintained the right atmosphere. Especially songs from Hans Zimmer.\n\nI enjoyed the day ceremony outside in the garden the most. There was a moment when the long-accumulated anxiety and fears inside me seemed to fall away suddenly and I could’t stop laughing out loud for several minutes. It was a relief I hadn’t experienced in a long time.\n\nBesides ceremonies I really enjoyed the art sessions where I could express my insights. Yoga classes were really useful due to my lack of movement and I have learned that yoga isn’t just about physical stretching muschles but contains also other deeper aspects.\n\nAt one of the workshops I learned something new about the roles in victimhood triangle. There were a lot of useful info that you can integrate into your life after the retreat.\n\nOh and I have to mention the dishes, every meal was delicious despite being mostly vegetarian.\n\nThe whole retreat concept was well-tuned and I experienced an unforgettable week. Big thanks for that opportunity.','\n',char(10)),'Lukáš Kaláth',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('8122516a-8ba6-4d9c-8d1c-3211202b7a11','363aabf4-291c-45e0-99b5-0bee9cd42b6f','This place is closed. I spent a week in Urubamba and passed by this place many times in different times of the day and there is no sign of this restaurant. The doors are closed in the address provided by google','Google Reviewer',3);
