INSERT INTO Review VALUES('e2ac0be5-f2a5-4f69-8072-3b80deec8a2a','e60a1c00-3d4b-4953-b8e0-8be3465a539d','Delicious fresh food and amazing deserts!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('463a9590-0247-4d66-a243-df03bb5c5149','e60a1c00-3d4b-4953-b8e0-8be3465a539d','Cute and cozy cafe with lots of foods, drinks and desserts . Owner is very artistic','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('cbc9be3a-8232-4e97-9556-410b5dc77caf','e60a1c00-3d4b-4953-b8e0-8be3465a539d','It’s such a nice cute place. I stopped in by chance to escape high winds but I came back a few times afterwards. It’s a lovely environment and everything I tried there was really really good','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('a92e84a2-0c4c-40ec-850d-fce51f6b1b5f','e60a1c00-3d4b-4953-b8e0-8be3465a539d','Exelente!!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('8864a9fe-99b6-4fdd-b873-b266479a2a07','acf93ea5-c3a2-4a4f-89cd-a26eba3c3bd2','What a lovely cafe in Urubamba! Became our absolute favourite.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('79f301e4-251c-46fa-ab3d-5440ef713e25','acf93ea5-c3a2-4a4f-89cd-a26eba3c3bd2','Amazing place, amazing atmosohere! See You soon!!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('9337c274-25f3-4e05-bbfc-c2550c5374a9','acf93ea5-c3a2-4a4f-89cd-a26eba3c3bd2','Für mich das beste und entspannteste Café und der leckerste Cappuccino in Urubamba. Danke 🙏','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('a5da9035-fd14-48ea-a1c6-594c1d85060c','acf93ea5-c3a2-4a4f-89cd-a26eba3c3bd2',replace('Un verdadero refugio para los amantes del café ☕✨. Cada taza está cuidadosamente preparada, resaltando sabores únicos que difícilmente encuentras en otro lugar. El ambiente es acogedor y perfecto para desconectarte o trabajar con tranquilidad. Además, no es solo una cafetería: es un espacio para verdaderos apasionados del café. Encontrarás una gran variedad de métodos de preparación como V60, Chemex, prensa francesa y más, junto con accesorios de alta calidad para que puedas llevar la experiencia a casa y perfeccionar tu propio ritual cafetero.\n\nSi aún no lo visitas, este es el momento. Ven, prueba su café de especialidad y descubre por qué vale totalmente la pena. ¡Seguro querrás volver! 🔥','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('3d4279a7-0dd7-4098-adaa-87781358fe99','acf93ea5-c3a2-4a4f-89cd-a26eba3c3bd2','Henry is the nicest host and makes the best coffees! Since years this is one of my favorite places for a delicious coffee (Americano cortado), tasteful dessert and happy chat in Urubamba.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('d1fb72be-e34a-41aa-9acd-a65c8b5f3947','1f748def-ef57-4cce-a18a-4dc2cc50ea29','Muy buena experiencia! Recorrido completo tal como dice la descripción de su página web! Nuestro guía frank y tupac muy bueno! Siempre atento y motivador se la pasó muy lindo. Recomiendo 100% la agencia','Gustavo Navarro',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('1230cd08-752d-4b87-b058-facc9ddc2cc4','1f748def-ef57-4cce-a18a-4dc2cc50ea29','The trek was a great experience, and our guide Tupac was incredible at keeping the energy and spirits up even when the hike was challenging and weather conditions were not ideal. He went above and beyond in helping other members of the group when they lost some of their items. The food was great, the mango ceviche especially was a highlight.','Smiti Narayanan',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('94fe235f-7770-4028-9840-95be2aa74f75','1f748def-ef57-4cce-a18a-4dc2cc50ea29',replace('During my months of traveling through South America I have done many guided tours — but the Salkantay Trek was one of the most unforgettable thanks to the Machu Picchu Expeditions team, and in particular because of our incredible guide Tupac. It is hard to fully describe how much enthusiasm, humor, knowledge, and care that Tupac put into our tour, constantly going above and beyond (and at one point even lending his own shoes to a trekker). Plus, we are so grateful that we were put in Tupac’s group, because it seemed like compared to the other trekking companies we were always the ones having the most fun ☺️\n\nAdditionally, the food was unlike any food I had ever had on a hiking tour. I was expecting chicken and potatoes for every meal, and so I was very pleasantly surprised when we got to have restaurant-quality meals, including dishes like trout and mango ceviche.\n\nFinally, the horseman was fantastic, ensuring that our duffels and supplies were safely delivered to our accommodations each day.\n\nThank you to the entire MP Expeditions team for making our time on the Salkantay Trek so memorable — will be strongly recommending this company to all of my friends.\n\nMy only recommendation to the company is to offer a one page PDF with all of the important details/logistics for the Aguas Calientes / Machu Picchu day, including the return to Cusco. There were a lot of things to remember, and it would be helpful to have it all written to avoid confusion.','\n',char(10)),'Lauren Kearns',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('602d2a80-364f-4fee-b889-9af1d0224116','b1a92544-37a5-4337-89ce-8f2d26adeb4f','We had a wonderful time with Peru Summit Adventure. From the itinerary planning to the service, food, and accommodation, every detail was thoughtfully arranged. The owner and guide were very attentive and friendly, and communication in English was completely smooth. I highly recommend this excellent small local company.','kai dan',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('05869d51-0949-4c4f-a569-8373ac2a3d52','b1a92544-37a5-4337-89ce-8f2d26adeb4f',replace('We booked a Sacred Valley day trip with Peru Summit Adventures and it was, without a doubt, the highlight of our entire time in Peru. From start to finish, every detail was taken care of and we left with memories we’ll cherish forever.\nOur tour guide Simon was absolutely world class. His knowledge of the Sacred Valley was impressive and his energy was infectious throughout the day. What truly set him apart was his genuine care for the people he was guiding - he went out of his way to facilitate a very special moment for my fiancé and me, something we will never forget. If you’re lucky enough to have Simon as your guide, you’re in for a treat.\nOur driver Juan was equally fantastic - professional, reliable, and a pleasure to be around. He made every transfer smooth and comfortable.\nWe came away having learned so much about the history and culture of the Sacred Valley, and we had an absolute blast doing it. If you’re visiting Peru, do yourself a favor and book with Peru Summit Adventures. You won’t regret it!','\n',char(10)),'Thomas J',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('2a362f4a-c2a6-4cca-81d7-38808ac07433','b1a92544-37a5-4337-89ce-8f2d26adeb4f','If you are planning to visit Cusco or any of the many amazing attractions in and around Cusco, including everything from Machu Picchu to Rainbow Mountain and beyond, I would HIGHLY RECOMMEND Peru Summit Adventures! They are incredible! I sent my wish list to Carlos and he turned it into a full detailed itinerary for me that was flawless! Our driver, Percy, picked us up at the airport in Cusco and took us to the hotel when we arrived late in the evening the first night. Then the next morning, Percy and our tour guide Simon picked us up at the hotel to take us to the Sacred Valley and had several amazing stops along the way including the Moray Ruins, Maras Salt Mines, the Ollantaytambo Fortress and more! They dropped us at the hotel in Ollantaytambo at the end of the first day and gave us a great restaurant recommendation for dinner. Day 2 we took the train to Aquas Calientes and then the bus to Machu Picchu where Simon guided us through with an awesome tour of the archeological site. We then tried to take the train back to Ollantaytambo but a cargo train had derailed and the trains were down the rest of the day. But Simon and Carlos helped us find a great hotel for the night there rather than waiting it out with hundreds of people in the train station and they also took care of getting our train tickets changed for the next morning. Day 3 after we took the train back with Simon to  Ollantaytambo, Percy was there waiting for us to take us to the Pisaq Archeological Ruins and the town of Pisaq where Simon guided us through the ruins and then down the mountain and into the town before they took us back to our hotel in Cusco for the night. Finally, the next morning, Percy came to take us to the airport for our return flight to Lima. Percy and Simon were awesome!!!! The entire experience was incredible and they took care of EVERYTHING for us each day with the logistics, tickets, transportation, tours, etc. Carlos recommended great hotel options for us as well which was the only thing we had to book ourselves. We opted for a private tour so it was just the two of us with the same driver and tour guide throughout the trip. And everywhere we went, so many people knew our tour guide Simon and stopper to say hello to him and he said hello to many people along the way as well. Worth every penny! Best travel experience with any tour company I’ve ver had and they handled so many details for our three days in the Cusco area! Thank you so much Carlos, Simon, and Percy and the entire Peru Summit Adventures team!','Jeff Butler',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('9afca4cc-025a-44da-b2c3-b044fe1b9012','121a5b90-8510-465e-829d-2f332d97d048','Lugar maravilhoso com história de tradição inca','MARIA DA PENHA MELLO',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('437965a3-133b-493c-befd-1bb7e0c7c966','121a5b90-8510-465e-829d-2f332d97d048','Lugar hermoso e historico que debes conocer si tienes la posiblidad, destaco todo el trayecto que debes hacer para llegar allá, Cusco y Aguas Calientes,lugares bellos','Laura Leiva Andías',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('ba2cab9e-cbcb-4c31-a1ca-44027a8e39c6','121a5b90-8510-465e-829d-2f332d97d048','Sharing photos from circuit 3 in 2026. Provided amazing “traditional” views with a walk through the village. Highly recommend!','Monika W',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('0fe8c803-b85e-4799-a2c1-f56e0ffa8546','b6f83172-e2aa-4fe5-9786-b18f0bb64a90','Hernan was an amazing tour guide who communicated perfectly in English, answered all of our questions and ensured that we had a great experience at Machu Picchu. Highly recommended!','Jiahui Li',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('9877228f-48d7-458a-b4ff-c59bc07d60a5','b6f83172-e2aa-4fe5-9786-b18f0bb64a90','I booked Hernan for 7 days to accompany me while traveling solo around Cusco. The service was great, i had an amazing time with Hernan, everything was well organized','Tommy Chang',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('8ac7e46e-143b-4c14-95d4-b2531f1253fc','b6f83172-e2aa-4fe5-9786-b18f0bb64a90','We had a wonderful week exploring Machu Picchu, the sacred valley, and Cusco with our fantastic guide, Hernan.  He was very knowledgeable and made everything very easy for us. Transportation was always on time and he obtained all the tickets and permits we needed to visit the sights. Big thanks, Hernan!','H Gickling',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('3cf00918-7eb1-414e-9fd8-7f3b08f7e33a','d293aab0-5d8a-4a83-8d6b-13d24937110a','Un servicio espectacular de MTb enduro en Cusco súper recomendado gracias Daniel por el servicio, nos vemos pronto!!','Ausangate Adventure',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('da19779a-a85d-42d5-a6bd-80c866220814','d293aab0-5d8a-4a83-8d6b-13d24937110a','We had an awesome time with Daniel. There were ruins, alpacas, and the trails were so fun. Daniel had everything we needed for a good time and was a great guide. We''d definitely go again.','Brandon Webb',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('63cbb29f-e2f7-41e9-ba74-66c973b36e8d','d293aab0-5d8a-4a83-8d6b-13d24937110a',replace('We did a 21 mile ride through sacred Valley. It was gorgeous! I was riding through ancient farmland, past fields of fluffy llamas, down by the river with black pigs wallowing in the mud, children on the mountain side with their llamas. We saw families working on a small plot of potatoes. Rode up high above the ruins Moray.   Got an amazing birds view there.\n\nRode through the tiny town and had a lunch included a delightful overlook. Appetizer, entrée, drink, dessert included .\n\nThe restaurant had a big green grass lawn and tasty food. Clean bathrooms with toilet paper and soap. Then we continued further in sacred Valley to the salt mine. We could see it from far above and then dropped all the way down to the salt mine and were able to walk around and get free salt and buy some salty chocolate.\n\nThere is some double track in beautiful country. A lot of single track. It definitely had some gnar and spice. Lots of downhill. Fast and exciting. For me this is the absolute best way to see sacred Valley… Rolling on two wheels!\n\nWe were visiting from Utah and mountain bike all the time.  we don’t get to see giant agave bushes and wallowing pigs and llamas and Peruvians in their traditional dress at home! SOOOO FUN.','\n',char(10)),'erika wilde',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('69dc8ad5-ac59-48fd-897c-b277965d8c8a','142a1c52-0347-46f7-9608-7f9ee403da85','Had a fantastic experience with this team doing the 7 mile Inca trail hike to Machu Picchu and guided tour of Machu Picchu on the second day. Was very good price. All the communication and instructions were very well done. Our guide Papas was EXCELLENT and extremely pleasant and helpful. Would definitely recommend these guys!','Liz F',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('3d87ab6a-ea94-4892-8088-f6d36638c437','142a1c52-0347-46f7-9608-7f9ee403da85','Was a great experience doing guided 7 mile hike of Inca trail to Machu Picchu tour the second day. Papas was the very best guide! Everything was well organized and very good instructions given. Would highly recommend','Jeremy Ebner',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('78223f66-dd0d-4586-a227-3a89b93bd385','142a1c52-0347-46f7-9608-7f9ee403da85','We booked our Inca trail with Peru Treks. I would highly recommend this company as everything was organised perfectly. A delightful team led by the fantastic guide Juan Carlos who was not only super knowledgeable, fun, as well as encouraging for the whole expedition. This company goes above and beyond- wonderful food, lovely porters, the best campsites. They take care of everything, you just need to walk all those steps and enjoy the hike to Macchu Picchu😊','Sasha Kehoe',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('9c86bfd6-5ae5-4bfd-b708-c5c458502b8d','ac53507e-d8c9-4f42-9142-e45c3a7e1bae',replace('Hermosa experiencia, los porteadores realmente hacen una labor sobrehumana , el cocinero , nunca me imaginé tener semejante comida elaborada con tanto amor … todos los detalles y atenciones . El guía Juan De La Cruz excelente, supo manejar el grupo y adaptarse a las necesidades de cada uno . Realmente una inolvidable travesía .!!!\nLa única crítica constructiva para la empresa, deberían proveer de colchones más cómodos  y mantas de abrigo en las carpas !!!!\nCreo que toda persona tendría que vivir esta experiencia , como dicen…ES UNA LIMPIEZA ESPIRITUAL !!!!! Gracias !!!!!!','\n',char(10)),'L.A Administración',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('f72a97f2-945f-4d8a-ae80-d3ea3f22fb0b','ac53507e-d8c9-4f42-9142-e45c3a7e1bae',replace('Desorganización e incompetencia.\nNo recomendamos a la agencia Inka Trail Backpacker para realizar el camino Inca en un día, porque hemos tenido una experiencia muy negativa.\n1. Nos han puesto problemas con el pago en dólares retirados de un banco en España.\n2. El hotel en Aguas Calientes no se ha ajustado a la calidad del servicio pagado.\n3. Hemos tenido que reclamar a la agencia con insistencia a través del guía que se respetará el horario de vuelta  a Ollantaytambo en un tren anterior por el que hemos abonado un dinero extra.\n4. La agencia no ha coordinado el servicio de recogida en la estación para nuestro traslado a Cuzco, con lo que hemos tenido que esperar más de 45 minutos a otro conductor al que han avisado a última hora.\n5. Y, lo peor de todo, no han dado la cara para resolver todos los problemas.\n\nLo único positivo el guía, Ulrich (freelance, por cierto), que ha sido un gran profesional y ha estado pendiente de nosotros todo el tiempo, incluso solucionando lo que no le correspondía.','\n',char(10)),'Merche Berroci',3);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('a9793119-b91b-4714-91ed-ce0ad4d7c908','ac53507e-d8c9-4f42-9142-e45c3a7e1bae',replace('¡Increíble experiencia!\nSin duda la volvería a repetir, nuestro guía fue Giovanni y de verdad me encantó cada uno de los tours ya que hizo el viaje y la experiencia mucho más amena y enriquecedora, y además siempre estuvo súper al pendiente de todo el grupo. Y por supuesto la comida hecha por Fernando y Mario verdaderamente deliciosa⭐️','\n',char(10)),'Andrea Santillan',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('e48d3926-af65-46a1-80b7-28b3e63a0cd1','9ee247e1-3272-423f-b5bd-3f2303e0375d','Increíble experiencia junto a Explorandes, en especial con María Paula. Nos organizaron un viaje de novios espectacular, durante el cual no tuvimos que preocuparnos por nada. Destacaría todos los detalles que tuvieron con nosotros, la atención que recibimos en todos los destinos y la calidad de la organización y traslados.','Gema De Vargas Romero',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('8249a906-f5b1-4e02-844b-e2e753209c24','9ee247e1-3272-423f-b5bd-3f2303e0375d',replace('Mi experiencia con Explorandes en mi viaje ha Cusco, Valle Sagrado y Machupichu ha sido inolvidable. Todo el equipo se mostró siempre profesional, amable y disponible las 24 horas, anticipándose a mis necesidades y cuidando cada detalle del viaje.\n\nQuiero destacar especialmente a sus guías, personas con gran conocimiento de la historia, la cultura y las tradiciones locales, que lograron transmitir su pasión por el Perú de una manera cercana y auténtica.\n\nLas rutas elegidas, los hoteles recomendados y las sugerencias gastronómicas superaron mis expectativas. Más que una agencia de viajes, Explorandes ha sido un verdadero compañero de viaje, combinando organización impecable con un trato muy cercano y humano.','\n',char(10)),'Almudena Gurpegui Sedano',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('39ea4b67-ce8e-4eaf-932a-1b7c5cd89463','9ee247e1-3272-423f-b5bd-3f2303e0375d',replace('I am so grateful for Explorandes and our guide, Pamela. This was truly a once-in-a-lifetime experience and the company couldn''t have made it any more perfect. Yes, the views were absolutely breathtaking, but my favorite part of this trip was Pamela. She is one of the most thoughtful, caring, and knowledgable people I have ever met. It''s clear how much she loves her job, and it shines through everything she does. Even after the trip ended, my group and I couldn''t stop talking about how wonderful Pamela was.\n\nMake sure to book Explorandes (and Pamela) if you''re planning a Machu Picchu trip!!','\n',char(10)),'Taylor Berberich',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('095d42dd-e959-45c4-8bb3-5ce6f40b750a','896bdc50-7ca9-4ceb-910a-26ebdfd213a5',replace('Wir haben den 5-Day Salkantay Trek gemacht. Alles war top organisiert: das Vorab-Meeting hat bei den letzten Fragen geholfen, das Gepäck war stets pünktlich an den Unterkünften und uns fehlte es an nichts. Das Essen war meist abwechslungsreich. Nach einem Tag, wo die Veggie-Option mittags und abends Ei war, wurde es die folgenden Tage noch vielfältiger.\nDie Unterkünfte waren so luxuriös wie es zum Campen geht.\nIch fand’s auch gut, auch Sicherheitsgründen (Erdrütsche) lieber einen Abschnitt des Treks zu überspringen, als stumpf durchzuziehen.\nBei der Gruppengestaltung wird sich auch gut Gedanken gemacht: wir waren 5 Paare im ungefähr gleichen Alter.\nAuch super: mit Machu Picchu Tickets für 6am waren wir vor den großen Menschenmassen vor Ort.\nAn der ein oder anderen Stelle hätte jedoch besserer Informationsfluss stattfinden können:\nDass die Abholung morgens zu Fuß stattfand, hat mich zu der Uhrzeit doch etwas überrascht und kalt erwischt. Ich war mit offenen Schuhen nicht darauf vorbereitet, mein gesamtes Gepäck noch 5 Minuten zum Auto zu tragen.\nFür den Besuch der Thermalquellen hieß es, wir bräuchten nur Schwimmsachen. Und plötzlich musste ich in Flipflops noch einen Kilometer pro Strecke wandern, auf dem Rückweg dann im Dunkeln. Bei rutschigem Untergrund mit ein bisschen bergauf und -ab hat das leider wenig Spaß gemacht.','\n',char(10)),'Fiona',4);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('b20fa4db-e7bf-4de5-94b7-7fa2d3ad32a4','896bdc50-7ca9-4ceb-910a-26ebdfd213a5','This is a great company! Our trip is in june and they have already been so helpful since booking with them. Their costumer service is quick and very kind. We exchanged emails with Enzo and have nothing negative to say. We can’t wait to actually start our trek!','Emily Cote',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('1f626450-647e-4a8e-8ddf-7aeec162a2c4','896bdc50-7ca9-4ceb-910a-26ebdfd213a5',replace('We did the 6-day Salkantay Trek & Short Inca Trail, and it was honestly one of the best weeks ever.\n\nOur guides, Juvenal and Roger, were absolutely fantastic—so knowledgeable, friendly, and fun. They made the whole experience feel seamless and got us all up to the Salkantay Pass without any issues.\n\nThe accommodation, food, and overall hospitality were faultless. We especially loved the Jungle Domes and the views from the Sky Camps—each camp was completely unique and special in its own way. Some even had private bathrooms and hot showers, which felt like such a luxury after long trekking days.\n\nFor the final two days, it was just the two of us as the rest of the group were doing a shorter trek. We spent one of the longest (and most incredible) days trekking with Roger through stunning landscapes before arriving in Aguas Calientes. There, he handed us over to Juvenal, who guided us along the Inca Trail. Thanks to his expert timing, we had some of the Inca ruins completely to ourselves—such a special experience. We ended our adventure with a private tour of Machu Picchu in the sunshine, which was the perfect finale.\n\nEverything—from hotel pickup in Cusco to being dropped off again six days later—was perfectly organised and completely stress-free.\n\nI can’t recommend this company or this specific trek enough. If you want the full Salkantay experience but also the chance to hike part of the Inca Trail and arrive at Machu Picchu through the Sun Gate, this is 100% the one to book.\n\nWeather-wise, we went at the end of March and experienced a mix of rain and sunshine. I was a bit unsure how the rain might affect things, but it really didn’t at all. Days were warm, nights were chilly—pretty ideal trekking conditions overall.','\n',char(10)),'Connie Robertson',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('788c8703-d824-407c-94a4-95d201348706','6c720372-e259-4185-b793-dd7c00ea215d','"Our guide was incredibly knowledgeable and his English was perfect. It’s hard to find a reliable Cusco travel agency that truly cares about cultural education and not just ''ticking boxes.'' They tailored the pace of the tour to our needs and made sure we felt safe at all times. Hands down, the most professional Cusco travel agency we worked with during our trip."','Annie Diaz',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('97be8a07-db3c-4aee-b324-7879a74f1db6','6c720372-e259-4185-b793-dd7c00ea215d','"After researching many options, I’m so glad we chose this Cusco travel agency. They handled our Sacred Valley and Machu Picchu logistics perfectly. Communication was seamless via WhatsApp, which is a huge plus for international travelers. If you want a stress-free experience in Peru, this is the best Cusco travel agency you can find."','Edgar E',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('b4b4b8f2-2081-4e5c-848e-be40c0b09ea2','6c720372-e259-4185-b793-dd7c00ea215d','Our trip to Cusco was absolutely incredible thanks to this agency. From the airport pickup to the Sacred Valley tour, everything was perfectly organized. They handled all our train tickets and entry permits for Machu Picchu, making the whole process stress-free. If you want a reliable and professional team in Peru, I highly recommend their services!"','Munexa Spa Cusco',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('8c98d65d-b714-40bb-9edb-07b02f2681a9','dc1c8bdf-1474-4aa0-a1ba-de71e4286423','Essa agenda é muito boa , gostei !!’','Fatima Rodrigues',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('6df021dd-bb7b-4c4f-a087-ad13a68f9c3b','dc1c8bdf-1474-4aa0-a1ba-de71e4286423','Contratamos quatro passeios com a Inti: City Tour,  Vale Sagrado, Montanha Vinicunca e Laguna Humantay. Fechamos os passeios direto na agência e fomos bem atendidos. Todos ocorreram da melhor forma possível, pontuais nas retiradas e retorno, com guias excelentes que fizeram as experiências ainda melhores. Parabéns e obrigado aos guias Alfredo, Romário, Jesus e uma moça que infelizmente não me lembro do nome (City Tour) que além de compartilharem muitas informações históricas e interessantes, eram engraçados e otimizaram os passeios de forma que pudesses aproveitar ao máximo, visto que todos são muito corridos devido as distâncias, quantidade de paradas, etc... Recomendo muito a agência, possui um ótimo custo benefício ! Apenas como um conselho para melhoria da empresa, tivemos um pouco de dificuldade de comunicação pelo whatsapp antes de fechar os passeios, o que nos deixou um pouco apreensivo visto que já estávamos em Cusco. Também em relação ao passeio do vale sagrado, para as pessoas que vão permanecer em Olantaytambo para seguir a Machu Picchu se possível não precisar levar elas para a estação de trem ou hotéis, visto que a cidade é pequena e isso acaba atrasando a última parada que é Pisac. Mas de nenhum forma desqualifica a ótimo experiência no geral que tivemos.','Leandro Coelho Garcia',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('d6ded887-2945-44fc-8c47-944ae1cdc21f','dc1c8bdf-1474-4aa0-a1ba-de71e4286423','Hola, realicé el camino Inca de 4d/3n partiendo el 29 de marzo, en general me pareció excelente, estuvimos guiados por César él cuál se comportó de forma espectacular tanto en el trayecto como con los datos que nos daba. Adicional mente, resaltar el trabajo de los porteadores, los cuáles tienen un trabajo pesado, pero lo supieron realizar de la mejor manera, encantada con sus servicios. Sin duda volvería a realizar el camino Inca con ellos, pero en otra temporada para variar de microclimas.','ABY QUINTE',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('7ae5b395-b97b-446c-a4ea-0380c3a3bf90','b7088e84-8288-4bc2-b6c9-56f78594d1c1','This is the best company. They booked for us on short notice. All the guides were incredible. Worth your money.','Amar Sra',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('b17e5a1d-baf0-405a-ad86-b05b97b353d3','b7088e84-8288-4bc2-b6c9-56f78594d1c1','We just returned from a 6 day tour with Cusco Local Friend. We highly recommend this private tour group. Everything was perfect from the schedule, the communication, the accommodations and mostly our amazing tour guide Samuel and our driver Willie. Samuel was thorough in his explanations and extremely knowledgeable. Samuel was very easy to talk to and took his time at the various sites. He patiently answered all of our questions. The schedule we developed with Cusco Local Friend was perfect. It allowed us time to acclimate to the high altitudes. We were in the car a lot to get to the various sites and it was very comfortable. Driving can be a challenge and our driver navigated well. We came back with marvelous pictures (Samuel is an expert at the best picture sites), knowledge of the Incas, and Peru and its culture.','Sandra Snead',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('35fd38a7-0adc-4936-9524-8bba32bdd000','b7088e84-8288-4bc2-b6c9-56f78594d1c1',replace('We joined the Cusco City Tour hoping for a great experience, but honestly it didn’t live up to the expectations.\nThe schedule felt a bit rushed — we didn’t get enough time to enjoy the main sites properly.\nOur guide was knowledgeable but seemed distracted at times, and the explanations were too quick.\nAlso, the car wasn’t very comfortable for the long ride around the city.\nCusco is beautiful, but I think the tour could have been better organized and more relaxed.','\n',char(10)),'Donald Moses',1);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('2fb4f831-5007-4a79-a91c-ca58eb1de557','f695a251-0601-438a-aba3-b0d61b6a560f','Excelente Richard, me encantó. Se tomó su tiempo para responder todas las preguntas, explicó muy bien y muy amable. Y nos hizo un regalo','Sol Oliver',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('32b592ed-138d-4686-be6e-8f43dea5ff6c','f695a251-0601-438a-aba3-b0d61b6a560f','Elvis was a fantastic tour guide. So much interesting info and history!  Would highly recommend!','Veronica Cavallaro',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('91cc73d1-2774-4d6d-91be-4f5acc3462e5','f695a251-0601-438a-aba3-b0d61b6a560f','Richard took us on a fantastic tour around Cusco. He was incredibly knowledgeable and willing to answer all questions. Highly recommend this tour to get familiar with the city!','Heather S',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('d396f45c-581b-463d-bcbf-a1ef52f0bc9c','820f4898-c6cd-4351-96c7-9b38d66fa5f4',replace('Un tour pufff 😍, que te lleva a conocer los lugares más emblemáticos del Valle Sagrado de los Incas, como Moray, el laboratorio inca, o el rincón donde la civilización pre-inca extraía sal, lo cual se mantiene.\n\nSi vienen a Cusco, no dejen de hacerlo con esta agencia 😉.','\n',char(10)),'Daniela Moros',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('ca7940a8-8816-4002-825e-b85b789bb266','f223c986-58d9-4481-bfd5-4486cb81012c','Muy predispuestos. Responden rápidamente. Buscan soluciones. Nuestro de guía de Machu Picchu un genio ! Y la persona que atiende el teléfono siempre muy atenta.','Maira Villarreal',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('05f2844c-312f-405d-b2f0-40e6fad6d1cb','f223c986-58d9-4481-bfd5-4486cb81012c',replace('My wife and I did a day tour as well as an overnight tour with Peru Hiking Tours and we cannot speak more highly of all the crew. Our day tour through the Sacred Valley was amazing and our overnight tour to Machu Picchu was a dream come true. Every single detail was taken care of by the team, the guides were extremely friendly and so knowledgeable. The drivers were remarkably skilled with the traffic and roads around the valley- we felt totally safe and in capable hands. Thank you to Ros and Henry and our drivers Roger and Richard. Thank you for making our holiday dreams a reality! 🥰\nAlso they are great photographers 😋','\n',char(10)),'Nicole Vanderburg',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('71f4371c-61b7-4bd1-be8f-7f31c10c445a','f223c986-58d9-4481-bfd5-4486cb81012c','The most amazing trip of my lifetime with the best tour company in Peru.','hamid mozaffarian',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('1b34f30a-2502-4ceb-9165-2d232a6b599d','6e2bd0f6-1514-4617-8e93-3f8c916b320c','Todo perfecto con la empresa','Maxence Desjardins',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('95dcc2a3-9663-4a6d-ad55-d29ea43d8e69','6e2bd0f6-1514-4617-8e93-3f8c916b320c','Great tour with a small donation optional at the end. Absolutely worth the time and money. Guide had great English.','Stephen Elliott',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('c65af76a-3c21-423d-b1a3-8a5105a775ea','6e2bd0f6-1514-4617-8e93-3f8c916b320c','Me gustaba mucho, muchas informaciones 👍','Lisa',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('10733ff0-d22b-4fab-9577-41efe679e70a','35faf6c2-19bc-427a-8654-712f55aa638c','Excelente atención!!! Amabilidad, puntualidad, conductor servicial, todo bien. Muy contentos con José :)','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('69c99bef-6b87-4633-9f3c-602c20a21052','35faf6c2-19bc-427a-8654-712f55aa638c','En Setiembre viajé por primera vez a Urubamba con mi hermano y cuñada, y tuvimos la dicha de que José nos recogiera del aeropuerto. En los días posteriores nos hizo el servicio de transporte y guía a Pisac y Ollaytamtambo. Súper buen servicio, muy atento, claridad respecto a costos, buena comunicación y coordinaciones, auto súper cómodo y amplio. Si volviéramos a Cusco/Valle Sagrado volveríamos a contactarlo y desde luego que lo recomendaríamos a familiares y amigos.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('8549365a-692a-49d0-b763-7a70270b15e1','35faf6c2-19bc-427a-8654-712f55aa638c','Recomendado','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('47d9dbde-3583-47d5-b9ab-5cbbe92e825d','f2c3be2d-3c68-409a-9820-70ad5cb22e23','Fantastic tour — everything was perfectly organized. Special thanks to Naydu and KUYAY TOURS for making it great way back from Ollantaytambo to Cuzco with special visit in between !','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('365f8cf6-417c-4966-bc37-e77f6486a36f','f2c3be2d-3c68-409a-9820-70ad5cb22e23',replace('Il servizio è stato eccellente ma nulla in confronto alla simpatia, disponibilità e gentilezza di Naydu! ♥️\nÈ stato un autista fantastico, sempre pronto ad aiutarci e disponibile!\nSuper consigliato!','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('f00dd12c-dbbc-4201-929a-f089fe9a342e','f2c3be2d-3c68-409a-9820-70ad5cb22e23','Naydu is a very nice and energetic guy. Very kind and available for all our requests. Highly recommended.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('1a099c46-6709-472b-89c3-daec2cd013c3','f2c3be2d-3c68-409a-9820-70ad5cb22e23','El servicio de transporte fue excelente, pero no hay comparación con la amabilidad de Naydu, siempre presto a ayudarnos y siempre super servicial, 100% RECOMENDADO! Cuando vayan a Cusco y necesitan transporte, no dejen de contactar a Naydu!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('3c428d43-652c-4d10-90e2-c322b84c1050','f2c3be2d-3c68-409a-9820-70ad5cb22e23','Muy contenta con el servicio. Todo el tiempo mostraban amabilidad y cuando fue necesario alguna ayuda, muy gustosos de ayudarnos. Lo recomiendo.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('18da65db-044f-4fd4-aacb-0cb441e1ec59','60c6493e-24be-45a3-9554-395be7c26ffc','Hired a private car for the day from Cusco to Ollantaytambo stopping at all the sites along the way. Our driver Juan was excellent.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('a10f1518-08e3-4033-9e9d-8f98318e9ef3','60c6493e-24be-45a3-9554-395be7c26ffc','Qualità, cortesia e simpatia. Abbiamo preso un pulmino per andare a palcoyo, non solo ci ha portati al parcheggio ma visto che non avevamo una guida si è offerto di accompagnarci e ci ha spiegato moltissime cose, oltre ad averci fatto da fotografo personalec assolutamente consigliato','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('8b95312c-a032-41a4-9c73-e685fbd2b66f','60c6493e-24be-45a3-9554-395be7c26ffc','Ottimo servizio, abbiamo visitato Moras, Maras e Chinchero un giorno, e l''altro Pallcoyo. Assolutamente raccomandato, Hilario è stato gentilissimo e la sua simpatia ci ha reso la giornata indimenticabile','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('fd7b934f-95ba-4141-9f60-b4c11a1cb21a','60c6493e-24be-45a3-9554-395be7c26ffc',replace('Great friendly transport to Rainbow Mountain 🏔️ 🌈\nFelt very comfortable with our driver. He even supported us on the hike, something he didn''t need to do.','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('8c195476-33f8-49ab-8e46-3f5a4e45373e','cae4840a-ee11-4999-91c4-c165ae9c56e7','Muy buen servicio! Nos han ayudado muy rapido y el conductor y coche en muy buen estado!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('152d1b8d-c834-475e-befb-749a73e6a10c','cae4840a-ee11-4999-91c4-c165ae9c56e7','O serviço foi excelente, gostamos muito! O motorista Naydu foi muito atencioso e simpático desde a abordagem e, além disso, é um bom guia, cuidadoso no trajeto, sendo muito paciente e prestativo nas explicações e ao tirar as fotos. Recomendamos o serviço.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('02bc700d-f7c2-4b03-af0c-9a054dbd67f7','cae4840a-ee11-4999-91c4-c165ae9c56e7','Exelente servicio, la empresa siempre fue bien puntual responsable recomendado .','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('701b78c3-2054-465c-8fb9-52076d31a84a','cae4840a-ee11-4999-91c4-c165ae9c56e7','Servicio exlente','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('6c466786-64d0-42ee-82c5-874c4c6cc074','cae4840a-ee11-4999-91c4-c165ae9c56e7','Excelente servicio y calidad. La empresa siempre fue puntual en los tiempos y en cuanto al servicio de traslado, impecable. Volvería a contar con ellos en cada uno de mis traslados en Cusco y en el Valle Sagrado. Es una empresa de confianza!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('a8cb9817-0b0a-4aac-b350-bb04896089d6','3a184ec8-607e-4d49-9dad-75e321a32318',replace('What can I say about Guido. He was literally the saving Grace for us in Cusco. He took us everywhere did everything we asked of him and did it all with a smile. He arranged for all sorts of things that were not part of just driving us to point a and point b. Without him we would have had to drive our little rental car over some insane mountain roads. Just imagine you driving a little sedan 2 in away from a cliff that drops down thousands of feet. I really think you want the most experienced driver you can get. And that''s Guido. We saw everything there was to see in the region thanks to him. He never rushed us and always had a fun anecdote about the area or the place we were visiting.\n\nI found him ththroufh the Airbnb host that uses him for all of her clients. She herself uses him as a driver because he knows the area so well that in local can appreciate that knowledge. His vehicle is a well-equipped Mitsubishi 4x4. We were a family of two adults and two teenagers, and we all fit comfortably inside his SUV. I have no point where we scared by his driving, as he is very responsible and respects all laws and rules of the road. Which is not something that everyone else does while you go on trips with Guido. He''s there early not just on time, he plans ahead and cleans his vehicle after every single trip that you take with him. So the next day you''re going back on a slick and clean ride. He treats adversity with a smile and charges honest fees for his services.\n\nDo not be afraid about the language barrier. If you point and show him the places you want to go he will get you there for a fraction of what those so-called "tour guides" that speak crap English and really don''t have any knowledge of anything nor any business giving you a tour. That''s why having a knowledgeable driver will get you really far in the Cusco area.\n\nI consider Guido a friend after all the experiences we shared over the week or so that we traveled with him.','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('a5a3c1c7-0447-4f7b-9efa-262042b1417e','3a184ec8-607e-4d49-9dad-75e321a32318','Muy seguro y confiable. sobre todo unidades modernas','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('8ac59ff9-f23d-4f03-8ef4-662860b77a02','dabaec53-4738-4fe0-9e59-d37033492675',replace('I highly recommend this taxi service. They were friendly, very reliable, punctual, and never over charged. They made our stay in the scared valley enjoyable and stress free.\nAnd Christian Villar was fantastic!','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('49f47359-1913-47ee-ad71-a75631a60443','dabaec53-4738-4fe0-9e59-d37033492675','¡Christian fue increíble! Fue sumamente confiable y conocía a la perfección todo el Valle Sagrado. Nos llevó todo el día desde Ollantaytambo, Moray, las Minas de Sal de Maras, Mountain View Experience, Pisac, y de vuelta a Cusco. Incluso ofreció paseos para explorar los sitios arqueológicos de Cusco. Es amable y muy justo con los precios. Confié mi vida a él en las empinadas alturas de los acantilados, y condujo de manera segura. No puedo recomendar a un conductor mejor. Conoce a fondo todo el Valle Sagrado y seguiré recomendándolo a otras personas.😄','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('b2ae0438-fbd8-4261-83a0-2842329fcab6','dabaec53-4738-4fe0-9e59-d37033492675','Christian Villar was always smiling and enjoys making conversation. Good company and service.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('57f71a73-f143-4ab2-952b-e023e24ad72a','dabaec53-4738-4fe0-9e59-d37033492675','Taxi tours valle sagrado urubamba','Google Reviewer',5);
