INSERT INTO Review VALUES('60c34e4a-ffcf-45d9-967c-3f2ec5b8427e','9c446081-7fea-44e7-89ce-44295c10336f','Muy buen servicio, puntualidad, buenas unidades y conductores profesionales. Me transportaron al aeropuerto, estación del tren y a los atractivos turísticos del valle. Los conocí el 2024, volví a utilizar en 2025 y volveré a contactar cuando vuelva.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('b27af238-63fb-4ccb-9c35-7467c79b25c2','9c446081-7fea-44e7-89ce-44295c10336f','Jhoel has been amazing organising my trip to my personal interests and helping me out during my stay in Cusco and the sacred valley. The privately guided tour at Machu Piccu was certainly my favourite.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('488e6e47-633f-4747-86c8-01112c1f4665','06768a20-a611-4c38-b0f4-81d386f3c43b','I highly recommend Max. A safe driver, arrives on time and very friendly.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('defb3cd4-b225-4363-a5b8-b06497d42c79','06768a20-a611-4c38-b0f4-81d386f3c43b','MAVITOURS es un servicio de taxis fantástico. Max es un joven muy amable y con una amplia educación, durante el viaje del Valle Sagrado a Cusco aprendí mucho acerca de la minería y la juventud en el Perú además de sentirme segura y tranquila con un chofer responsable.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('83fb6084-822c-4047-9727-4258ef024391','06768a20-a611-4c38-b0f4-81d386f3c43b','Max is a super taxi driver, always on time. His taxi is extremely clean and comfortable. He’s excellent advise on places to visit too. I highly recommend him for a pleasant and safe trip!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('7db54993-9cf1-4481-a26d-71e90ce4a596','06768a20-a611-4c38-b0f4-81d386f3c43b','We had a great experience with Transporte Urubamba Mavitours. Máx Jonathan was our driver and guide for the day, and he made our trip truly memorable. He took us to see the ruins, Maras, Moray, Chinchero, and other nearby spots. Máx went above and beyond — sharing local insights, helping us take great photos, and ensuring we were comfortable and enjoying ourselves throughout. Gracias!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('9cb27469-2837-466c-9de2-24dfa1000cd7','e0b75314-58a6-4c8c-a708-9a9a32311f48','¡Excelente servicio en Cusco! Saúl fue súper confiable y se adaptó a todo lo que necesitábamos. Fue muy amable con nosotros y el precio fue bastante justo. ¡Totalmente recomendado!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('3813e4f6-962d-4843-878e-8d8e8c195dee','e0b75314-58a6-4c8c-a708-9a9a32311f48','Buen servicio 👍','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('e6439a07-b42d-4000-b001-342295f7df9c','e0b75314-58a6-4c8c-a708-9a9a32311f48','Saúl nos llevó a ollantaytambo y nos esperó mientras paseábamos. Después nos llevó a otros puntos del valle sagrado y fue muy amable, atento, puntual y tenía mucha información sobre los diferentes lugares. Súper recomendado! Pablito también nos hizo un tour al sur y fue muy atento. Los dos súper recomendados!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('90982020-56f5-403e-815f-c5e3fe9f1a3a','e0b75314-58a6-4c8c-a708-9a9a32311f48','Super journée avec Saul dans la vallée sacrée, il est dynamique, conduit bien et donne de bonnes explications, et surtout très sympathique.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('01fbcd6d-f876-4470-8ee0-2d4086ebae09','e0b75314-58a6-4c8c-a708-9a9a32311f48','Excelente viaje con Ruth! Muy puntual y sentimos una conducción segura, nos esperó en cada momento y nos tomó fotos!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('647dc49c-45fa-4b5c-8022-a541b98f9e2f','88cf6d0a-e467-4d49-9249-04bcbb0f6059','Enrique es un hombre muy amable y nos hemos acomodado mucho durante nuestra estancia en Urubamba. Siembre lleva sonrisa y nada es demasiado esfuerzo para el! Buen precio, buen viaje! Gracias 5 ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('cc8c2a58-a731-4f79-ae17-0f0419609cc2','88cf6d0a-e467-4d49-9249-04bcbb0f6059','Excelente servicio de Enrique','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('1a17625e-a95c-4ce9-8831-612deb5ab2b6','88cf6d0a-e467-4d49-9249-04bcbb0f6059','Enrique was so friendly and accommodating throughout my journey to Ollantaytambo and Urubamba. Highly recommend his services','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('93f7b3f2-a7b5-4212-b469-17e838070886','88cf6d0a-e467-4d49-9249-04bcbb0f6059','I truly recommend this service. Very smooth ride, on time and fair prices. I have also learned a lot about the places we were passing by.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('0ad72816-8412-4084-85ad-7bce07bda92c','88cf6d0a-e467-4d49-9249-04bcbb0f6059','¡Excelente servicio! El Señor Enrique estaba super puntual a la hora acordada. Manejaba muy seguro y con mucho cuidado. Todo el Tour estaba muy pendiente para nuestro bienestar. Muy amable y cortes. Recomiendo plenamente al Señor para tours por el Valle Sagrado.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('18267218-7216-41cd-9638-f91e51b59945','aeb2ca85-b526-4c35-af91-ad40cb04997f','Hermosa experiencia en este lugar y hospedaje, todo muy acogedor! Nos llevamos lindos recuerdos y amistades nuevas (incluyendo a Freyja la gatita de la casa🫶🏼)! Gracias Saphi Kuna, volveremos pronto','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('0b64e702-5fdc-4e38-bcc2-8d41a4d27eac','aeb2ca85-b526-4c35-af91-ad40cb04997f','Super vista y servicios complementarios muy buenos. El espacio tiene una energía muy sutil y esta muy cerca del Centro Arqueológico de Pisaq y de los Apus y sus lagunas. Gracias por acogernos.','Google Reviewer',4);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('44de69ad-68e2-4a50-8eb3-24023469fd84','aeb2ca85-b526-4c35-af91-ad40cb04997f','Excelente, lugar para conectar con uno mismo y la naturaleza descansar como.nunca antes','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('e2463bf5-cc7b-4da8-900b-5cd76a616a0f','aeb2ca85-b526-4c35-af91-ad40cb04997f',replace('Es un lugar precioso, de energía amena, el personal es genuinamente amable, y las habitaciones súper cómodas.\nDisfrutamos de una fogata llena de risas y al día siguiente hicimos temazcal, la que fue una experiencia extraordinaria.','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('353218f9-077d-41a2-9cab-8ea02e77cd5f','aeb2ca85-b526-4c35-af91-ad40cb04997f','Un bello lugar , muy acogedor, lindo los paisajes de nuestro Perú, recomendado .','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('4da6de2f-61ee-4418-9692-a1bc8b03777f','8d3d5095-9311-4458-86ec-37d42da7d1ee',replace('I feel deeply grateful for the time I was able to work with Luca.\nWhat started as a short visit unexpectedly became almost three months of shared process, learning and transformation.\n\nWhen I first planned to come earlier, life delayed my journey and looking back now, I clearly feel that I arrived exactly at the right time. Luca met me with presence, patience and a very grounded, supportive energy throughout the whole experience.\n\nHis ceremonies are strongly guided through sound. He works with traditional icaros and a wide range of instruments that create a very immersive and safe space. His voice and music helped me connect more deeply with my own process and supported emotional release and integration in a very natural way.\n\nWhat I appreciated especially was the balance between ceremonial depth and human warmth. Luca holds space with sincerity and respect, and he stays available between ceremonies to support reflection and integration.\n\nFor me, this work created meaningful changes in my inner landscape and how I relate to my life.\n\nI’m grateful not only for the healing work itself, but also for the connection that developed along the way. I truly hope our paths cross again in the future.\n\nIf you feel called to work with plant medicine and are looking for someone who combines musical depth, sensitivity and integrity in his work, Luca is a beautiful guide to walk part of that path with.','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('04538659-723b-4893-b2ae-e9e612e814ae','8d3d5095-9311-4458-86ec-37d42da7d1ee','I had an incredible experience with Luca during my astrological chart reading.  From the beginning, Luca’s intuition and ability to create a welcoming and safe environment-even virtually-truly stood out.  Within just five minutes, he pinpointed the key themes in my life, all of which perfectly matched what I’ve been focusing on over the past year.  If you’re on a journey of self-discovery and looking for real clarity and alignment, I wholeheartedly recommend Luca.  He’s genuinely gifted!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('e8dff1a0-c567-45a9-934e-98942345cac6','8d3d5095-9311-4458-86ec-37d42da7d1ee',replace('Back in August 2025, I experienced the masterful orchestration by Luca was nothing short of a symphony for my soul and spirit. The layers of vibration and the mastery of the instruments created a mystical atmosphere that allowed for a profound inner exploration. It wasn''t just music; it was a vibrational healing that resonated in every cell.\n\nI also had an evolutionary astrology reading. 2 hours of download! It provided clarity I was seeking and revealed some information which is coming to light now. So profound. Thank you Luca🙏🏼💫','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('7d2c2ce8-c47a-45ab-8b24-1174e22c4ab2','8d3d5095-9311-4458-86ec-37d42da7d1ee','I’m beyond grateful that, through a simple twist of fate, I was connected to Luca for an evolutionary astrology reading. The reading came at a rather chaotic time in my life where I felt confused, lost, and exhausted. Luca and his knowledge of astrology helped me understand some of the reasons why I felt this way, and gave me some guidance as far as what choices I have to help resolve the current situation. During the whole reading, I felt heard, respected, and cared for. Luca is so gentle and kind, and I have so much respect for what he does. His passion, guidance, and real knowledge of astrology is undeniable.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('74b8f50f-58a0-47da-9c23-7b9116cdc54a','8d3d5095-9311-4458-86ec-37d42da7d1ee','Ayasana Wasi was a transformative experience for us. We had a private, six-day retreat for two people, including three ceremonies filled with music and wisdom. We were fully supported and surrounded with care and empathy throughout the entire experience. Luca and his team have thought of everything. The temple is a beautiful, sacred space of healing. Luca is an amazing, inspired healer and musician who guides the ceremony with his tremendous experience, wisdom, and intuition. The integration sessions with ceremonial cacao were a vital part of the retreat, allowing us to dig deeper into the meaning of our experience, to establish intentions for each ceremony. Luca is a highly skilled evolutionary astrologer. The work with our charts added an important layer of meaning. Finally, the setting in the sacred valley, among the mountains, is indescribably beautiful, the accommodations were very comfortable, and the food was amazing—especially the soup after the ceremony and Luca’s magical blueberry pancakes in the morning. If you are looking for a wonderful experience, this is the place!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('1d942f62-8158-4878-a702-d63432da54b7','4d7cf654-1b55-41b3-ba83-a76ce73e97c6',replace('🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟\n\nA Transformational Sanctuary at Vida Wellness Center 🌿✨\n\nFrom the moment I stepped into Vida Wellness Center, I felt an energy of peace and renewal flowing all around me. ✨🙏 This is so much more than just a wellness center—it’s a sacred space where body, mind, and spirit are nurtured in harmony. 💫\n\nThe gym is truly next level 🏋️‍♀️—beautifully equipped, bright, and inspiring. Every workout felt like an act of self-love rather than a chore. I left each session feeling stronger, clearer, and more connected to my purpose. 💪🌱\n\nI also fell in love with their new café ☕🍃. The healthy menu is absolutely delicious, with fresh juices, nourishing meals, and the most calming atmosphere you can imagine. Sharing tea and wholesome food there felt like a soul-reviving ritual.\n\nThe entire team radiates kindness and wisdom. Everyone I encountered was dedicated to helping me grow and heal, from the therapists to the reception staff. 💖 Their genuine care shines through in every detail.\n\nIf you’re searching for a place to reawaken your spirit, energize your body, and open your heart, Vida is a true sanctuary. I’m endlessly grateful for this experience and can’t wait to return. 🌿✨🙏','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('dd430ea9-cea1-49a1-bc04-92d85822d354','4d7cf654-1b55-41b3-ba83-a76ce73e97c6','Nice place. Lots of activities going on. People are welcoming.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('fa93aabc-1cb8-40a9-98c1-3db2d8f59d98','4d7cf654-1b55-41b3-ba83-a76ce73e97c6','The owner is the most beautiful and vibrant feminine, and then joining the events is pure fun. It''s a true community space with dance, martial art, a cultural market, readings, the gym of course and heartcentered fun people. Great if you wanna connect and meet new souls after training yourself 🥰','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('788b6ea7-1ebb-47a7-851b-9610c5acf1cc','4d7cf654-1b55-41b3-ba83-a76ce73e97c6','We came here for some workouts and loved the vibe. The owner is very friendly and the functional boxing class we visited were exactly what we needed. If you want a good gym with friendly, lovely people around, this is your place ❤️','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('55dbb386-486b-4e50-aac4-ca660eff7015','f5271226-876d-4b97-8a89-ad28158a76a6','I can explain how much gratitude I have for Luca and Timo for walking, guiding and opening the window for me! I have never felt so alive, vibrant and understanding in my life. The journey I was seeking led me to Luca and I trusted the journey fully because of his energy and frequency. The temple is a wonderful and safe space to embrace the medicine and and fully give and receive! The ceremonies were amazing and transforming, I couldn''t be any happier for being led to this wonderful retreat. Muchos Gracias Luca and Timo 🤙','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('1d8a54e7-c427-498a-9047-801527e4db30','f5271226-876d-4b97-8a89-ad28158a76a6','After experiencing various spiritual retreats and sitting with numerous shamans and spiritual teachers, nothing has felt as complete, profound, or fulfilling as working with Paul Diamond. He is one of the most gifted and compassionate shamans I have ever encountered. His ability to seamlessly integrate wisdom from different shamanic and spiritual traditions adds such a remarkable depth, skill, and expertise to everything he does— as well as giving more openness to the work, as well as doing it at a level I’ve never experienced before. Beyond only participating in ceremonies, I now have daily practices outside medicine work that enrich my life in ways I couldn''t imagine and I''m now an apprentice in multiple wisdom traditions that brings me immense joy. I always feel blessed to have come across this school and the very rare shamanic expertise of Paul Diamond. I would recommend this school, this work, and Paul Diamond to anyone interested in what the school offers. It''s so much more than just shamanism, it offers expansion in so many beautiful ways. 🙏🪷','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('df35994d-77a3-4430-af2b-b62f7fe00e87','f5271226-876d-4b97-8a89-ad28158a76a6','Working with Paul has been the catalyst for the most meaningful changes I’ve experienced. His teachings carry a rare depth and clarity—profound, authentic, and deeply impactful. Paul''s pure-hearted approach radiates in every interaction, and the way he transmits wisdom is nothing short of extraordinary. The devotion he embodies, coupled with the immense love, care, and energy he pours into his work, creates a space of true growth and inspiration. I feel incredibly blessed to have had this journey with him and even more to continue it.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('a5657edb-c5f2-420b-abde-a7681089e524','f5271226-876d-4b97-8a89-ad28158a76a6','The best place on earth, I feel at home here. People, place, food, study—I love it all! I will definitely be coming back!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('5137a00c-43e7-4035-90e0-f1054dc3c7e6','f5271226-876d-4b97-8a89-ad28158a76a6','Absolutely incredible. Working with Paul is unlike anything I have ever experienced. Thank you also to the wonderful volunteers and administrators who helped keep our retreat going as smooth as it did. What a truly life changing experience. Can’t wait to be back.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('0207c753-cb57-4728-af28-3130043e102c','a21656c1-37f1-464a-8713-709633c79086',replace('Just had a ceremony with Alberto.\n\nAyahuasca is not for everyone, but if you do trust the story, it takes you to meet your inner self.\nIt was safe and full with love.\n\nThanks Alberto\n\nPeace and love,\nSimba','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('4f0279b5-e83f-49b7-9b2d-d78f29bba513','a21656c1-37f1-464a-8713-709633c79086','Fantastica esperienza in un luogo meraviglioso. Alberto si è preso cura di noi in modo eccellente, offrendoci una ricchissima colazione ed anche di riaccompagnarci a Cusco personalmente. Super consigliata!!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('97a3f0bd-3bb4-4028-a2f1-95a8f2d6615e','a21656c1-37f1-464a-8713-709633c79086','Wonderful experience of ayahuasca and San Pedro ceremonies. Alberto is really welcoming and caring host, he always makes sure everyone feel safe and can dive deep into own healing journey. The house and the location is very beautiful too. I’m extremely grateful for those experiences and can ensure that anyone who doubts to come or not - come, you will be get what your souls needs here🦋🪬💫','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('d192cd79-64ff-4ce4-81ab-47eda1e0d3da','a21656c1-37f1-464a-8713-709633c79086','Alberto made a wonderful experience for us would highly recommend!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('23ed98c5-91f5-4cf4-9a84-591a0a0ab6ce','a21656c1-37f1-464a-8713-709633c79086','Was slightly nervous before arrival as a solo female but the excellent reviews are deserved, I felt totally comfortable here. Brilliant experience. Thank you Alberto!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('6414a79b-67c2-4bfe-9339-ad85c01b7f3e','41d4bb36-0f2c-4c36-bc77-5763d6958368','Gran equipo de trabajo interdisciplinar, unen medicina tradicional con terapias alternativas','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('8c9d7784-6ca3-4ffb-b9b5-2c57f7ec0ff2','461b5697-d61c-4ec3-a256-cc9fe3b90874','Four times over three years I went to the three days full moon silence meditation retreat as participant. I believe in the power of silence and the magical island in lake titicaca. From all silent retreats I can find I prefer this one, since three days is gentle and the different practises provided by the content/teachers give an amazing support. Meditation, yoga and healing with support of the full moon is practised. Also, through the sacred hikes to the two mountains on the island (pachamama and pachatata), a beautiful opportunity is given to work with the masculine and feminine energies in our bodies. The first time I went to retreat I awakened my intuition around subtle energies in our bodies, that I know often use in self healing or in healing others. An experience I never forget!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('1dd09712-ba3c-4ed1-8d3f-b4bfe9f909c4','461b5697-d61c-4ec3-a256-cc9fe3b90874','My spiritual journey and practice is rich with meditation, qi-gong, and yoga and always includes the important event to go into retreat. Silence and stillness is an essential container for self-awareness. My first retreat with Meditation Retreats Peru was so transformative and convincing that I went again. Each time was filled with an opening and healing that was profound. It''s a great opportunity for me, now, to be invited to participate in these retreats as a teacher and guide. Namaste.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('390d3b07-c04f-4985-8be2-b3800e61ac88','461b5697-d61c-4ec3-a256-cc9fe3b90874','This place has a very calm and relaxing vibe. I was able to connect with my inner self and to see parts of me I hadn’t seen before. I loved my time here.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('52a491a0-1d8b-4cb5-8e3b-6b89807fc5d1','461b5697-d61c-4ec3-a256-cc9fe3b90874','Hermoso y tranquilo lugar para parar por unos días el viaje y descansar, meditar y tomar unas clases de yoga!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('c955ce9f-57de-43b8-90bb-4fcff9f90784','461b5697-d61c-4ec3-a256-cc9fe3b90874','Great experience really amazing place I really enjoyed thanks for all :)','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('dca2cb5a-fb5e-42a3-a129-590409a3dc79','5a08b4a1-e9f3-4200-87e4-e045b5089f25','Wow!!! Amanda🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥I slept with great relief today. My body is delighted with your yoga. Very soulful and joyful. Thank you.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('56469aa0-f2cf-4c52-a19e-930fc78f30d2','5a08b4a1-e9f3-4200-87e4-e045b5089f25','I came to Amanda for a session of kambô and I highly recommend. She has a very beautiful medicine space and is a highly educated and compassionate practitioner. She was willing to speak to me in depth aabout kambô and its effects on the body. Her vast health knowledge coming from her nursing background helped me trust that I was in good hands. I will be going back!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('0efc5191-5841-4819-8c57-cc4f3adf0207','5a08b4a1-e9f3-4200-87e4-e045b5089f25','Honestly it’s the place to book for your Pisac stay ! It’s 5 min from town in the hills - with gym & river & run route in the same distance. Amanda & the team are so welcoming - you gonna feel like home real quick no worries. Great healing combo between plant / western medicine also paired with awesome events like yoga / ecstatic dance etc','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('cf388506-8a11-45da-bee0-fd554eb5cecc','5a08b4a1-e9f3-4200-87e4-e045b5089f25','Amanda at Casa Holística was absolutely amazing to my wife and me. Her depth of knowledge across so many different treatments was truly mind‑blowing—especially her expertise with ozone therapy. If you ever find yourself in Pisac, Peru, do yourself a favor and schedule some time with Amanda and her wonderful team. You can thank me later!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('c83a0044-c784-467b-8874-89c6b274be9e','5a08b4a1-e9f3-4200-87e4-e045b5089f25','Amanda created a warm, inviting, safe space for my shoulder injury.  With her care and treatment, I recovered full range of motion after a motocycle accident.  I highly recommend working with Casa Holistica for everything from IV treatment, brain mapping, altitude recovery, you name it she''s got it!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('03958572-4a33-4707-a764-b148b1a8da4f','6378f1a2-6152-49ff-8569-0591be78610f','Beautiful community/family in the valley who works with different plantmedicine like Huachuma, tabaco, rape. Their Temazcal ceremonies are genuine, authentic, heart orientated. Would highly recommend.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('44f24ba7-53c4-46a7-80fa-1426ccfc9570','6378f1a2-6152-49ff-8569-0591be78610f','It''s hard to put my feelings towards Michi Hampi into words, I came for one month and ended up staying almost 3 months. I will be forever grateful to Mitsu and Vero for welcoming me into their family and the community. The place seems to attract the most wonderful people and it''s very easy to feel at home here. They give a lot of time and effort to each person staying at the community to help them grow. I always felt very safe and guided by them both in the ceremonies, and no two ceremonies were the same. I learnt alot here about myself and really hope to return soon. ❤️','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('82e07770-6df5-4a96-bb70-dbba9fee728f','6378f1a2-6152-49ff-8569-0591be78610f',replace('Llegué a Michi Hampi con intención de quedarme unas 4 noches, 5 quizás... Pero no ha sido así, me he terminado quedando dos semanas, y si hubiese tenido la oportunidad hubiese quedado más tiempo sin duda. Ha sido un placer compartir tiempo, espacio y comunidad con la gente que me ha tocado, estoy muy agradecido con todos.\nEn mi caso nunca había hecho ninguna ceremonia con medicina, y creo que si este es tu caso o aún habiendo ya hecho alguna ceremonia, tengo la sensación que el amor, el respeto y la cura con la que se toman la medicina en Michi Hampi es especial.\nEn algún momento nos volveremos a cruzar, no tengo ninguna duda.\nBuen camino, familia!','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('b9322e05-16a0-457d-9bc8-6094a76bdaf9','6378f1a2-6152-49ff-8569-0591be78610f',replace('This place was such a good deal on my journey! How little I knew when entering this communal space. Gives a space to heal, to feel and to breath. Comes together with magnificent mountain views all around.\nPrepare to blend in the community, to share foods with them (optional) and different types of workshops and ceremonies. Temazcal is must do here!','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('23aed4bd-bd7c-4854-b4ff-77fed89f7996','482d4b49-67d4-450a-9d9f-ca582989b32b','This place is incredibly accessible to the Pisac community surrounded by the healing mountains and right in the midst of a beautiful community of people.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('b4fa79a6-0b36-4a51-9c55-fe976cebb6c2','482d4b49-67d4-450a-9d9f-ca582989b32b','Beautiful space for events, and rooms for accommodation. Really prime location in rinconada right near the beautiful river. The owners are really friendly & supportive. It’s a great hub to connect in with community if you are spending more time in Pisac too. 🍃🤍','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('87d8dba8-a19a-4d4f-8403-422bc64dea72','482d4b49-67d4-450a-9d9f-ca582989b32b','Unreal spot! The location, the facility, the staff, the atmosphere, and the views! Doesn’t get better than this. Best place you could land for a pre or post integration retreat. I will be back 100% 😁','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('0b03f8e6-f0bf-41b2-b862-34910d84c0aa','482d4b49-67d4-450a-9d9f-ca582989b32b','HIGHLY RECOMMENDED!! 6 STARS! Psychic Garden is the best place for community events and camaraderie in all of Pisac. A top notch venue and staff located just outside of the town by the most beautiful archaeological site and small majestic river that runs off the mountainscape. The music events are the best in the area. I''ve been to 4 in the last 5 months and they are unreal. From San Francisco we take our beats seriously and these artists and DJ''s are world class level. The vibe is incredible. So much love and joy. Zero attitude. Zero Ego. Zero Problems.  All smiles and hugs. I vote for them every Friday I just cant get enough of that. Thank you for making it a very special place.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('b32463f8-0b06-4f5d-8c1c-aba1ed28625d','bd6ba8ab-94da-4d1a-bad6-8c98dad4cc39','Closed. No sign.','Google Reviewer',1);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('44fae268-2fc2-4888-aadc-6239c1a96cca','bd6ba8ab-94da-4d1a-bad6-8c98dad4cc39','My experience with Peru Shamans was more than good, it was perfect. I want to say a big Thank you to all of you, Janet, Jenny, Lucas and el Maestro for making me feel like home in your retreat center! You did an amazing job preparing me for this ubelievable journey that I had. Jenny and Lucas were amazing during all that time. Lucas helped me like a real brother of mine, gracias por eso hermano! Jenny was kind to me like a real sister. Maestro helped me to get through the dark moments of my journey and to have an unforgetable ceremony. From the bottom of my heart, thank you guys!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('5c44cd8e-e289-41cd-966e-653036c41837','bd6ba8ab-94da-4d1a-bad6-8c98dad4cc39',replace('I did a one day Ayahuasca ceremony.\nIt great amazing, they took care of everything, i felt very safe and they made the experience as comfortable as possible.\n\nDefinitely a life changing experience.\nI can recommend using Peru Shamans','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('427857e3-212a-4ca1-80bf-8b8f69c43412','bd6ba8ab-94da-4d1a-bad6-8c98dad4cc39',replace('Aug 26,2024 I attended the ceremony. The retreat center is a safe place with lots of personal care; the Shawman was very good. The guide spoke english and provided detail information for first timer like me.\nI rated this place 4 because the location is bad. And the car they provided to take us was not good for the road we needed to travel. Finally leaving the center immediately after ceremony was like killing the experience. Travel time is about 2 hours from Cusco through not so good neighborhood. So 3 hours travel time and 3 hours ceremony is what you get. I didn’t feel well for the next 24 hours. With all that said, I didn’t even bother to attend the second day. Amazing enough, the center has room to hold the guest for one night to have a better experience but they chose not to offer it. I believe you can find a better center for $450. By the way the photos posted has nothing to do with this center.','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',4);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('885533e2-dd0b-493d-86a8-118e494df9d1','bd6ba8ab-94da-4d1a-bad6-8c98dad4cc39',replace('Hi, I am Samantha and I recently attended the 2 DAYS SAN PEDRO DEEP HEALING IN MACHUPICCHU with Peru Shamans. I was guided on the journey by Walter and Maestra Lucia, which was a powerful and unforgettable experience. They are very caring and loving people who work with the medicine and the land beautifully. I connected with both of them very strongly and felt immense gratitude to be in their presence. I signed up to this experience as I wanted to visit MACHUPICCHU and I had heard great things about Peru Shamans. This journey far exceeded what I thought it would be. I felt so connected to the land, the mountains, my true self, and the medicine.\n\nMy favorite thing about the retreat was being with Walter and Maestra Lucia and connecting to the land. We also meditated and visited a beautiful waterfall, which I loveddd. This experience has impacted me positively in so many ways and I can’t wait to visit Peru and connect with Walter and Maestra Lucia again. I highly recommend this experience to anyone who is looking to have a profound experience in MACHUPICCHU with SAN PEDRO, the mountains, beautiful people, and their own heart.','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('5732bc15-37b6-4699-bf2c-d5bf48b44c8b','3873775b-c71f-4c1a-84bb-a5d74888fa73','Did 2 ceremonies of Ayahuasca, from the moment I arrived I felt safe and in good hands. I was there solo and was pushing myself out of my comfort zone but Edgar and the shamans explained everything so beautifully and couldnt have been more accommodating. The meals were fantastic and the area is peaceful, the perfect place to reflect. The history and lore behind the plant medicine was explained in such detail and Edgar has such an impressive grasp of English. They helped to guide me through my experience and you build a great connection. The morning after each ceremony you have a debrief with the shaman and talk about the experience. I couldnt reccommend this place enough. I am quite shy natured and it was my first time doing something like this, I felt supported throughout and felt safe to be vulnerable. This was the most significant experience of my life so far and I cant wait to get out into the world having faced off with issues that were holding me back. I hope some day to come back and see what else I can learn! :)','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('705cd523-e6b6-462e-bc88-088612f0cf57','3873775b-c71f-4c1a-84bb-a5d74888fa73','Mein Freund und ich hatten hier ein unvergessliches Erlebnis in einem 3Tage Retreat mit San Pedro und Ayuhasca. Wir fühlten uns von Anfang an unglaublich aufgehoben. Besonders Edgar und auch Cindy haben unser Fragen und Wünsche übersetzt und waren immer für Gespräche und Geschichten offen. Ein wunderschöner Austausch - und ein bleibender Eindruck auch dank der großartigen Schamanen, die uns auf unserem Weg begleitet haben.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('39fe4043-a0b3-4160-ac74-a39ca5c0e569','3873775b-c71f-4c1a-84bb-a5d74888fa73','To all that are looking for a retreat  to dive into yourself physically  and spiritually janser,cindy,the shamans and the cooks all give 100% of their energy and time to take you where you need to go..we did san pedro and ayuhuasca  in 3 days and I feel like a new born....I will be forever in debt to you all for showing me something beautiful 🙏🙏🙏🙏','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('49b10ca7-0016-4194-a4e6-5d6fb6798e4d','3873775b-c71f-4c1a-84bb-a5d74888fa73','Great and very caring people that know what they are doing!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('1cd9d2d1-4bf6-49ca-adb8-52e5452f30ab','3873775b-c71f-4c1a-84bb-a5d74888fa73','This is the best experience of a lifetime that you will have. Shamans, Janser , Cindy will make you feel like family. I did a 7 day retreat and i believe this was the best decision of my life. I came all the way from India and I am so happy I did it.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('ab96b4c6-3423-4223-bd8e-3fc744a0b068','3fd18c83-dc6a-466f-901e-8f1ecb8953a0',replace('From the moment we considered booking with Healing Tree, we were treated so well. At first we spoke with Italo, he helped us prepare, understand what we were doing, a 3 day Huachuma ceremony. We were delayed a day due to flight issues and they were very accommodating allowing us to shift everything a day, telling us not to stress, remain calm and it will all work out perfectly.\nWhen we arrived, Alfredo came to our airbnb and helped us with the salt water cleanse, further explaining the next steps and process for the ceremony. He was so knowledgeable and very kind. After our retreat he also met us and made sure we made it to our next Airbnb. He offered us any recommendations should we need it. And we did take him up on that with help arranging a driver to tour the sacred valley at our own pace, and a delicious local cuisine restaurant. Alfredo was truly wonderful.\nWhen we arrived at the retreat, we were met by our host Aquile’s, we were shown to our rooms which were lovely, very large and had our own bathroom and shower. After being shown to our rooms, we were brought tea to help calm our systems, and given time to settle.\nWe met with our Maestra, Lucía Shaman Andina after this, I was delighted to learn our Maestra was a lady, as a female in a group of men, I was so happy to find this out. She was beautiful, she sang wonderfully, was very connected with nature, she had a wonderful personality and was quite funny.\nDuring our ceremony, we were surrounded by nature after a little hike, and the second day we hiked to a beautiful waterfall and made an offering to Pachamama. Things that I prayed for began happening immediately after.\nAquiles had a beautiful voice, played many wonderful flutes, was very personable, spoke wonderful English, and had a great sense of humour as well. He communicated with the Maestra for us and translated everything. The bond between the Maestra and Aquiles was wonderful, made it easy to relax, their easy going demeaner with one another was perfect for the environment we had hoped for.\nHuachuma was hard on my stomach, however I anticipated this. I felt my body was what required the healing, they were so helpful in my recovery for this, from specialty teas, special fruits and suggestions on how to recover.\nFrom the moment of first inquiry to the moment we left Peru many days later we were treated so amazingly, the ceremony, Maestra and staff were wonderful. I highly recommend the Healing Tree Center if you are considering working with any plant medicine experiences. I know they offer more than just San Pedro (Huachuma).','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('4d949ef4-5317-4498-8f7e-279e34195b62','3fd18c83-dc6a-466f-901e-8f1ecb8953a0','This place is the real deal. If you are ready to take traditional medicine and heal your soul, I cannot recommend healing tree enough.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('9266bc11-ecc9-4b69-860d-c6f86163a87c','3fd18c83-dc6a-466f-901e-8f1ecb8953a0',replace('September 2nd-10th, 2025\n7 day 4 ceremonies. Life changing.','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('70429423-0931-4932-bf66-0b4175c14fa4','3fd18c83-dc6a-466f-901e-8f1ecb8953a0','La mi experiencia con healing tree fue maravilliosa. La comida y la habitacion eran muy buenas. Particolarmente ne gustsria destecar el trato cariñoso hacis mi durante las ceremonias. Los 2 chamanes han combinado habilmiente conocimientos ancestrales con nuevas descubrimientos cientificos. Muchas gracias','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('b43df97b-ffe9-4b52-bcad-77ef6b0e770c','3fd18c83-dc6a-466f-901e-8f1ecb8953a0','We came for a 3 day 2 night retreat. The staff we had were all very welcoming, helpful, and friendly. I would definitely recommend The Healing Tree, and I will plan to come back.','Google Reviewer',5);
