INSERT INTO Review VALUES('d17c3397-8f57-43b4-8a4d-668b1f915160','25dc614f-bdfa-47a6-8d84-07b0a4519ae8','Super friendly, lots of fun, gorgeous scenery and great ATVs! It was my first time driving this type of vehicle and they’ve been really patient with me. Highly recommend','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('19ef3281-402e-4c48-b9f8-adff3bfb3f4a','25dc614f-bdfa-47a6-8d84-07b0a4519ae8','Hoy hemos disfrutado de un tour muy chulo con Johan, que es un guía sensacional. Te cuida muchísimo y ha adaptado nuestra reserva a las condiciones climáticas dándonos confianza y flexibilidad. Sin duda, toda una experiencia. Gracias por todo!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('a5f29847-14e2-42ed-9c8b-b02dd57b2569','25dc614f-bdfa-47a6-8d84-07b0a4519ae8','Best place to rent a bike, when I’ll be in cusco again I will definitely go back here again','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('4ba5a46b-f36e-46f5-811e-acedd9861eaa','25dc614f-bdfa-47a6-8d84-07b0a4519ae8',replace('Four of us traveled to Peru and rented pristine bikes from Peru Moto Tours—what an incredible experience. The bikes were in top-notch condition, and the level of service and support was truly first class.\n\nWe rode several hundred miles through the mountains to the backside of Machu Picchu (Hidroeléctrica) and back to Cusco. Everything ran flawlessly, which made it easy to just enjoy the ride and take in the scenery.\n\nThis was truly a once-in-a-lifetime adventure, and Peru Moto Tours played a huge role in making it that way. Highly recommend.','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('1498f2fa-8190-4a49-a217-dadbe4271c3a','25dc614f-bdfa-47a6-8d84-07b0a4519ae8','Best place to rent a motorcycle.They are perfect can''t be more satisfied.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('2e8d8b62-0749-4ef0-a559-28170d10e229','d03d4a4c-2447-4b7a-9efd-51cad79c4fe5','Mala experiencia MI ESPOSO SE ACCIDENTÓ  , por qué no tuvieron las llantas revisadas .','Google Reviewer',1);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('91a1dedc-b67d-455e-91c2-d44f4a88eaf1','d03d4a4c-2447-4b7a-9efd-51cad79c4fe5',replace('I probably wouldn’t recommend this tour. There was me, a girl, and 4 other boys on the tour. One of the boys bike broke down half way through so they had to ride together. I booked with the option to ride the quad bike solo which is more expensive than if you choose to ride 2 people together, but upon arrival I found out that I had to have the tour guide on the back of my quad bike with me the whole time. I already thought it was weird he picked me, the only girl, when there were four other boys which would have been more decent. During the route he kept asking me questions about my age and if I was single which was quite annoying. I asked him why he couldn’t ride his own quad bike and he said it’s because it’s broken but there were many quad bikes/motor bikes in the garage. He also asked if he could hold my waist and I told him that shoulders is better. He then said he was scared of falling so I asked if he’d rather go with one of the boys and he was adamant on staying on the bike with me. Anyway it was just a bit annoying because I paid the full price to ride alone but instead had some man asking intrusive questions on the bike with me the whole time.\n\nNot only this, you have to pay 5 soles directly to the guide to park next to a lake for 15 minutes which seemed ridiculous.\n\nAnyway the route was lovely.','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',1);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('e90ac99d-4e49-4ed5-b30d-bcb15a992305','d03d4a4c-2447-4b7a-9efd-51cad79c4fe5','Excelente, time super simpático, Holger muito atencioso!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('47aecd9b-e1b0-483b-8560-a58db4cf0ce5','d03d4a4c-2447-4b7a-9efd-51cad79c4fe5','Adorei a experiência, o guia Arturo nos explicou muito bem!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('3c889ce1-1aa2-4e89-893f-fbf519d0ee5f','d03d4a4c-2447-4b7a-9efd-51cad79c4fe5','Excelente recorrido!!!! Laguna Piuray y Modara de los Dioses','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('5f71a829-c761-416b-8f34-411825cb7487','43a92254-9289-434e-a3bf-969b8fb7abc5','We had an excellent time. Juan was an excellent tour guide, prepared for anything. The ATVs were incredibly well-maintained tires were in good shape no issues whatsoever. And of course the terrain and the views were spectacular.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('95e17eae-4313-4877-9a64-ee5a78804acc','6d8b7b77-98eb-494c-b5b7-55e56ae0db83',replace('Te recomiendo vivir la aventura con Adventure on ATVs cuatrimotos-huasao.\n\nUna experiencia increíble para recorrer los paisajes del Valle Sur en cuatrimoto. Los guías explican muy bien cómo manejar, el equipo es seguro y el recorrido pasa por lugares hermosos como Huasao, Tipón y caminos rurales llenos de naturaleza. Es una actividad perfecta si te gusta la aventura y quieres conocer Cusco de una forma diferente.\n\nMuy buena organización, atención amable y paisajes espectaculares. ¡Totalmente recomendado! 🏔️🏍️✨','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('bac452a4-2cbd-4a77-8b67-b6fdada14d8c','6d8b7b77-98eb-494c-b5b7-55e56ae0db83',replace('Calidad de atención, buena indicación antes de iniciar el tour.\nrutas variadas de acuerdo a las preferencias de Los clientes 10 de 10 personal comprometido con tu seguridad y diversión. Muy recomendadooo','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('ccb1c5b1-98d2-47a8-aaa8-5d0859fabdff','6d8b7b77-98eb-494c-b5b7-55e56ae0db83','Excelente atención muy recomendado','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('5cd42c6d-bc60-48a6-9e53-4895eb028bd7','5be330c8-b7de-4650-95ec-622ad411f817',replace('Ich habe die Tour zur Lagune Huaypo und den Salzminen gebucht. Die Strecke an sich wäre sehr schön und es gäbe viele tolle Fotomotive. Entgegen der Beschreibung,zahlreiche Fotostopps zu machen, bleibt man nur 3x stehen und nur ein Fotostopp bietet ein schönes Motiv. Ich habe den Guide auch angesprochen ,warum wir nicht bei den tollen Fotospots anhalten. Er sagte,das komme noch. Von wegen! Am unverschämtesten fand ich, dass man bei einem Restaurant an der Lagune für 25 Minuten anhielt, obwohl es dort am allerhässlichsten war und dann auch noch 5 Soles pro Person zahlen musste. Ich wollte nicht bezahlen,da ich sagte,dass es hier nichts zu sehen gibt. Der Guide sagte, dass müsse jeder bezahlen,das sei für die Community. In Wahrheit war es der Eintritt für einen Bootssteg,sonst nichts. Die Quadtour dauerte insgesamt 1 Stunde 45 Minuten, davon stand man 25 Minuten einfach nur herum. Außer auf dem Steg konnte man nirgends herumlaufen.\nAuf dem Weg zu den Salzminen mussten wir dann wieder eine halbe Stunde in einem Souvenirshop verbringen,wo der Guide selbst eine mehrminütige Verkaufspräsentation durchführte. Achja, ganz am Anfang musste jeder noch 3 Soles zahlen, auch für die Community. Auch wenn das nicht viel ist, das geht so nicht.Insgesamt eine halbe Kaffeefahrt ohne Möglichkeit die Schönheit der Lagune zu fotografieren. In dieser Form ist die Tour nicht zu empfehlen.','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',2);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('c22818aa-0a4e-4abc-96fe-396770625e33','5be330c8-b7de-4650-95ec-622ad411f817','Freddie and Floyd were absolutely amazing and this was an excellent ATV tour. It was a little cold with a bit of rain but we still enjoyed the tour. 5 STARS!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('4b07a699-3bac-43b3-aa84-6e458e6c4470','5be330c8-b7de-4650-95ec-622ad411f817',replace('Our group of five was looking for an adventure on our way from Cusco to Urubamba, and this tour was excellent. They helped us build a custom all-day tour and it was easily a highlight of our time in Cusco.\n\nWe spent four hours on the ATV and got to not only see the hot spots but to get the adventure of having our ATVs. Our guide Wilson was excellent and gave us the history and context without feeling like it was scripted. Carla was great to communicate with on WhatsApp to help schedule. They even picked us up from Cusco and delivered us to our Airbnb. Highly recommended all around.','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('8ad04a60-fe3e-47fe-a2bd-dd43aee82987','5be330c8-b7de-4650-95ec-622ad411f817','This was an awesome tour! It was so cool getting to ride up to all the historic sites. Our guide was knowledgeable and let us spend as much or as little time at each stop as we wanted.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('e9c72cb0-1728-48d2-8498-19071293ea20','166e461b-6d41-4616-b9d3-93aead9d04f7','Great service and guides were really friendly and helpful. Definitely a lot of fun.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('79929844-534b-4c1c-93a4-ed02bef73afe','166e461b-6d41-4616-b9d3-93aead9d04f7','Excelente experiencia, vinimos en pareja y nos gusto mucho, el viaje dura aprox. 1h de ida y 1h de vuelta.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('04934019-a2a9-477f-9048-36faa8065e24','7dc7f7ac-2f4a-4bda-a7c3-6f57eb245ddb',replace('Experiência incrível...super profissionais  desde a reserva até o final do passeio !! Recomendo a todos essa agência.\nParabens','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('46720ca7-ba2b-4016-9820-f2d17b8afe0e','7dc7f7ac-2f4a-4bda-a7c3-6f57eb245ddb','Muy recomendado, experiencia muy bonita, desde principio a fin, las cuatrimotos en buen estado, guías pacientes y entendibles. Movilidad cómoda y se cumple con todo lo acordado 🤩','Google Reviewer',5);
