INSERT INTO Review VALUES('a243c05c-ae99-4d3e-baf2-107737d6c3d7','5b3c979e-a2e2-4087-a381-02a05d299aa6','First time ATV rider but enjoyed the tour very much. Our guide Joel was great.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('79b0fa4a-2971-42b9-a3b2-b4e6581022d2','5b3c979e-a2e2-4087-a381-02a05d299aa6','We enjoyed the ATV tour and had a good time exploring the Sacred Valley. Our guide, Joel, was helpful and made sure everything went smoothly. I’d recommend this tour, especially if you’re a bit done with big hikes and want something different.','Google Reviewer',4);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('c2c91459-6857-4f46-b1a2-c113cb2a18a9','5b3c979e-a2e2-4087-a381-02a05d299aa6','Amazing tour by Joel! He and the driver are very friendly. I had a really good time trying quad bike for the first time. The view is stunning!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('e95e1c20-627b-44df-a551-6945812b53a4','387200f6-ef7a-4578-b8e4-1e16a5477cad','Un hermoso lugar , precioso,maravilloso no hay palabras para describir el lugar , pero hay una observación constructiva ,muy pésima atención en la boletería , se supone que los residentes  tienen el acceso  libre mostrando su DNI , últimamente están que cobran, me parece falta de respeto ala comunidad donde vivo , y como  afisionada alas caminatas  me siento frustrada y triste , espero que la  empresa pueda  ver ese punto , en la boletería solo dinero Son decisiones de la empresa solo la respetamos y entendemos solo son trabajadores , muy apenada con este hecho siempre fui y nunca hubo este percance , mostraba el DNI y  súper y felices entraba con los amigos que llegan del mundo ... Una pena ...','Google Reviewer',1);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('5399bc89-0c25-4abd-a029-5e60e341a2d3','387200f6-ef7a-4578-b8e4-1e16a5477cad','Very surprising place.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('427db3e3-c521-41de-b087-f450ed4c7fec','37c1ebff-a781-46c2-ba05-0fa5ffca1343','This quiet inn has the perfect combination of location, facilities and kindness. It is one of my favourite places because it is family run, immaculate and has the most fabulous views. The shower is always hot, the bed is super warm and comfy, and my breakfast was tailor-made to suit my quirky plant-based diet. 10 out of 10 for everything and an extra 10 for incredible service.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('c2f42b56-d520-4aef-89c0-767294992f54','37c1ebff-a781-46c2-ba05-0fa5ffca1343','2박을 하는동안 친절한 젊은 주인 부부에게 감사했습니다 한국인이라면 꼭 필요한 라면물이 필요해서 뜨거운물 이곳에서 파는 생수 사서 끓여주십사 부탁드렸는데 그냥 무료로 끓여주셨어요 객실은 소박하지만 위치가 매우 좋고 덕분에 이틀동안 잘 다녔습니다 감사드려요','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('c5cf0173-c4fa-4077-9cb6-1fe4d7b22777','37c1ebff-a781-46c2-ba05-0fa5ffca1343','What a great location, the hotel is right off the town square. The workers are very friendly and the rooms are clean. We were surprised to have a mini-fridge and little snacks in our room as well. The breakfast is also delicious, the banana pancakes are incredible!! This place is a great value perfect stop on our trip.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('98428a5e-91e5-44a3-9870-6b41dec673cc','b6594def-106f-4f18-8fe6-6d2cbd33ace6','Great hotel with great staff. Rooms are wonderful too, quiet and nice views.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('28967777-a573-449e-82fb-7347cc4ca86a','3f6d459f-bdb6-4475-b04c-efb96004818f',replace('Nos fuimos tristes porque no pudimos despedirnos de chaska, 🥹\nLa atención 10/10\nLa comida 10/10\nEl lugar 10/10\nLa pasamos genial, súper recomendado, no queríamos irnos. Muchas gracias por todo ❤️','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('661df2cc-1633-4575-8472-efb99d5412cf','3f6d459f-bdb6-4475-b04c-efb96004818f',replace('Amazing experience!!\nWe have had so many custom requests, and they were willing to fulfill every single one of them, and always made it with a smile. It made us feel so welcomed 🥰 we had a great weekend, we were able to do a late check out and it gave us time to rest and travel around the area. We were truly sad to leave this amazing place, hope to come again soon!. Thank you Roger and team ❤️🦙','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('093d4bc4-2bda-4d1d-bea7-472004e19d73','3f6d459f-bdb6-4475-b04c-efb96004818f',replace('We stayed for 2 nights and I wish, it would have been longer.\n\nIn its category one of the best hotels I''ve visited all around the world.\n\nStaff was exceptionally friendly, food was delicious and the location really beautiful.\n\nShould I visit Peru again, I would love to stay there once more :)','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('2520f054-0608-4bde-9290-47d74748fa43','3f6d459f-bdb6-4475-b04c-efb96004818f',replace('An unforgettable experience at Miski Samay Domo Boutique! This is hands down the best hotel service we have ever received.\n\nA huge, heartfelt thank you to Roger, who made our stay perfect. Roger is a true professional—he handled every detail and every request with grace. From planning our daily itineraries and connecting us with the best local guides to arranging incredible meals, he went above and beyond.\n\nThe highlight was an impressive and authentic Incan ceremony that he shared with us—a truly moving cultural experience. If you are looking for a place that offers more than just a room, but a soul and world-class hospitality, this is it. Thank you, Roger!','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('e138488b-68c9-4854-ab73-fcd669157a52','3f6d459f-bdb6-4475-b04c-efb96004818f',replace('I truly liked everything! The breakfast, the staff (especially Royer, shout out to you!), the jacuzzi, the alpacas, the cleanliness, the location.\n\nThe staff is super professional and will do anything to make your stay more pleasant. Royer speaks perfect English and he is so knowledgeable. He has taught us a lot about the area and life in Peru.\n\nSo, what''s not to like about it?','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('6fc0c5c4-0779-4649-8590-112a0fc68127','9519531c-0612-4b34-b66d-91d1ab4ba6df',replace('The food and service here were incredible!\n\nWe started off with the trout tiradito and ceviche, and the alpaca carpaccio. They were all amazing and fresh. We then shared the grilled lamb with mash, and it was unbelievable.\n\nWe finished off with a brownie and a shot from the house.\n\nThe service was the most outstanding part. Super attentive, with a lovely and warm energy.\n\nI highly recommend.','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('c29f64ef-a9fb-4c93-8e8a-bf6618eb6426','9519531c-0612-4b34-b66d-91d1ab4ba6df',replace('Organic, locally grown food so expect higher prices than average for this town\n\nLimited vegetarian options exist','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',4);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('a004a65f-9458-4bb5-b143-e3dfb0841ef7','9519531c-0612-4b34-b66d-91d1ab4ba6df','Perfecto todo comida, tiempos, atención comida orgánica y ubicación','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('73c17496-4926-4539-867c-843f36320ea5','9519531c-0612-4b34-b66d-91d1ab4ba6df','Probably the best restaurant in Ollanta, and very convenient if you’re staying at the hotel. Honestly, everything is good!! The pasta, burgers, desserts all delicious. And service is excellent!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('afdaa8c4-7973-448b-9bc0-ac704cdf17de','b5e118d7-a23c-4489-a7d5-c99faa8f8aea',replace('Ich bin absolut begeistert von Juma Inka Tours und behaupte, dass sie die beste Adresse sind um den Bus bis Hydroelectrica zu buchen.\n\nWir sind ziemlich ahnungslos in das Reisebüro gestolpert und konnten ohne Probleme für den nächsten Morgen den Bus nach Hydroelectrica buchen. Die Kommunikation auf Englisch war problemlos möglich und Juan konnte uns sogar auf Deutsch mit vielen hilfreichen Tipps für die Reise nach Machu Picchu versorgen.\nDer Preis für die 4-Stündige Fahrt war super fair und Juan hat uns sogar noch eine Empfehlung für ein leckeres Abendessen in Ollantaytambo mitgegeben.\nAuf dem Rückweg sind wir ausversehen in den falschen Bus in Richtung Cusco gestiegen, Juan hat sich ohne, dass wir nachfragen mussten, direkt bei uns über WhatsApp gemeldet und mit dem Busunternehmen kommuniziert, dass wir in Ollantaytambo aussteigen müssen. Es war ihm wirklich ein Anliegen, dass wir wieder heile in Ollantaytambo ankommen.\n\nWir würden jeder Zeit wieder bei Juma Inka Tours buchen und sind Juan sehr dankbar für seinen sehr ehrlichen und freundlichen Service! 🙏🏽','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('249a1e70-bec8-4a41-b558-9ad0d2384bad','b5e118d7-a23c-4489-a7d5-c99faa8f8aea','I purchased the bus ticket to Hidroelectrica. Juan and his wife informed the drivers of my name and my pickup point/time for both trips. In addition, there was an issue with the bus getting into the main plaza. Juan and his wife went out of their way to hire a tuktuk and made sure I got on the correct bus. The price for the bus ticket was also cheaper than the other travel agencies in town. Highly recommended!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('086c8ad8-9dca-453a-ab2d-4aac37a7a46c','b5e118d7-a23c-4489-a7d5-c99faa8f8aea',replace('We had an incredible experience with this tour agency! Everything was super well organized, fast, and totally reliable. For an unbeatable price, we even had a private quad tour! It was perfectly timed, and we could take our time at each stop, without feeling rushed. We had full flexibility and could decide everything ourselves.\n\nOne big plus: the owner speaks German – which is rare – and communication in English was also smooth and easy.\nWe compared several other agencies beforehand, and this one clearly offered the best value for money. It’s truly a hidden gem and definitely deserves more attention. We’d book with them again in a heartbeat!','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('6ed71cb6-6dff-4ad6-a0b8-c10e4c3043e1','b5e118d7-a23c-4489-a7d5-c99faa8f8aea','Me encantó pero mucho frío. Vayan bien abrigados y con guantes subiendo granizaba. Bonita experiencia, bonita vista.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('a3f9c8d3-d9f0-4d80-961b-9bb27560721c','b5e118d7-a23c-4489-a7d5-c99faa8f8aea','Excelente la atencion de todo el personal en especial el de Yobana. 100% recomendable','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('57d01e76-bc61-412a-8b9c-c50f90a2ca21','a1a6f4f7-310d-4257-ad86-8788b19bf663',replace('Christian approached us outside the entrance to the site and helped with our purchasing of the tickets (before we even agreed to hire him as a guide) which was a great help.\n\nAt this point he offered his services and on entering the site he gave us a choice of 3 different routes and prices.\n\nWe always want to do as much as possible so opted for the longest tour of 2hr 30 mins. ( we are mid 60s, reasonably fit, I have asthma)\n\nThe steps up to the ruins are easy to negotiate; if not tiring with the altitude but Christian stopped at different terraces and used these stops to fill us in on all the history.\n\nHis English is superb and you can tell he treats this with a passion which is always great to hear.\nWe learnt so much.\n\nHe took so many photos of us at various stops and even managed to make me look good (ish😁)\n\nAfter ascending the ruins we spent quite a while at the top and he pointed out another ruins behind the football pitch, (which we visited in the afternoon) .\n\nOn the steady decent he also stopped a few times.\n\nWe then visited the lower ruins with more photo stops and we finished off with the Llamas and Alpacas.\n\nWe can honestly say this was one of   ( if not the ) best descriptive tours we have ever had.\n\nWhen it came to payment we were a little short on Soles and Dollars but this was not a problem as his brother has a shop where we could pay by card.\n\nThis part is what really confirmed how great and trusting the Peruvian people are.\n\nThere was a festival going on that day and his brother was involved, meaning the shop was shut.\n\nChristian told us no problem and that we could arrange to meet him later on to pay!!!!\n\nWe exchanged phone numbers and returned later to settle up.\nWe did tip in soles cash.\n\nIf you are in doubt about who to use in Ollantaytambo look no further.\n\nThank you again Christian 👏👏👏','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('12d06495-1c1d-4c55-bb94-66d289db3da7','a1a6f4f7-310d-4257-ad86-8788b19bf663',replace('So grateful that Christian was our guide at the Ollantaytambo Ruins. He is a knowledgeable guide, and a passionate storyteller. He made sure we felt safe and comfortable climbing up and down the steps. And he took good pictures of us too!\nWe really enjoyed the tour with him and hope to go around the other sacred valley ruins with him next time. 💯','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('7201e947-20c9-4278-86f0-88a2b9f738e8','a1a6f4f7-310d-4257-ad86-8788b19bf663',replace('Merci Christian pour nous avoir fait partager tes connaissances sur ce site de Ollantaytambo si précieux que nous avons adoré grâce à ta passion.\nCela restera pour nous dans notre périple un des plus beaux souvenirs !\nMerci mille fois.','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('c56d5b79-3949-49ed-8505-50cbf3d23eaf','a1a6f4f7-310d-4257-ad86-8788b19bf663','Christian our guide made the Ollantaytambo ruins a marvelous experience. We felt our experience turned our day into something very special. Craig and Ellen Marblehead MA USA','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('074aed52-3255-4c0c-8e37-13df08bc26d7','a1a6f4f7-310d-4257-ad86-8788b19bf663',replace('I was looking for a guide in front of the Ollantaytambo archeological ruins and met Christian there. He spoke English fluently and provided some information on how to enter the site. After some chatting, we decided to hire him to tour the Ollantaytambo ruins and it was our best decision ever. Christian is very good at sharing the history of the site and information on the Inca culture through very good story telling. He kept us engaged for over 1.5 hours with all the stories and information about Inca history and culture. He was born and raised in Ollantaytambo and we particularly enjoyed hearing the local’s perspective of the archeological site and town.\n\nWe enjoyed his guiding service so much that we hired him for a full day Sacred Valley tour the next day, starting from Ollantaytambo and ending in Cusco. He made arrangements for a private air conditioned vehicle that fit all our luggage and seated us comfortably. The price he quoted was very reasonable. We stopped at Moray, Maras, Chinchero and at Sacsayhuaman before being dropped off at the hotel in Cusco. In my opinion, hiring a guide is a must because of the rich history of the Incas. He pointed out many things we would not have recognized ourselves, such as location of water channels, archeological discoveries, and including a visit to a tunnel at Sacsayhuaman. I highly recommend the guide Christian and the team of tour guides that he works with.','\n',char(10)),'Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('93dc6424-5517-4f90-ac99-e6e3793ccc52','7b5c7961-4e8b-4b58-8697-5745281403d1','Hele mooie ervaring om de patronen beter begrijpen door het zelf te doen. Door docent  Nancy leer je snel en probeer je al in een sessie meerdere patronen uit. Super leuke ervaring!!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('027cbf5f-c477-496e-a9fb-a41b47e01c56','7b5c7961-4e8b-4b58-8697-5745281403d1','I had a wonderful time in the drop spinning workshop! I hope to come back to try weaving if I have time on my trip!','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('beff4d9c-4e73-4127-8a79-bf6a9cdab424','7b5c7961-4e8b-4b58-8697-5745281403d1','Great place to get some insights in the tradition of weaving. Would recommend the introductory course for weaving as it really gives you an idea of the work that goes into the beautiful things they make here! They were very kind and helpful during the course.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('f0a26dce-f481-48e3-93f6-5e4dc4e9326d','7b5c7961-4e8b-4b58-8697-5745281403d1','I took a weaving class here and had a wonderful time! This center is full of experts from communities that specialize in traditional techniques. You can take classes and buy items to support the center. I am so happy with the bracelet I made and have a new appreciation for all the larger hand woven pieces.','Google Reviewer',5);
INSERT INTO Review VALUES('d2ac649e-f439-45c6-96cd-bce6230f145d','7b5c7961-4e8b-4b58-8697-5745281403d1','I did the 1 day weaving course and i loved it! I learned so much. Katy is so patient and lovely, she doesnt speak much english and i dont speak much Spanish but it didnt matter. Perfect for a rainy day in cusco!','Google Reviewer',5);
